<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI INOGILE YANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Yohana ni chimwe mwa vitabu vine muna Dilagano da Sambi vovisimulila ugima wa Yesu Chilisito. Chila chimwe mwa ivitabu vine vino chotangigwa “Mbuli Inogile.” Masayo na Maliki na Luka na Yohana vandikigwa viyadanganike Yesu. Mbuli Inogile ya Yohana yandikigwa na Mtumigwa Yohana, iviya yodahika yandikigwa mwaka 90 kwandusila viyelekigwe Yesu. Viiwoneka chitabu hachilagusa bule kuwa Yohana niiyo yandike, ila ugenzi wa kwandika wiilinga na 1 Yohana na 2 Yohana na iviya 3 Yohana. Wandikaji wamwenga wakalile uko lusita ulo walonga kuwa Yohana kakala bululu da Efeso, kwa ivo yodahika kuwa chitabu chino chandikigwa muna dibululu da Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kolonga funhula funhula malungilo ya chitabu ni kuwataza wanhu kutogola kuwa Yesu Mkombola na Mwana wa Mulungu yeli mgima 20:31. Kwa kuhuwila dino chidahe kuwa na ugima kwa zina jake. Chitabu chandikigwa kwa chimu cha wasomaji wose, kwa Wayahudi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. Mbuli Inogile ya Yohana yoibasakanya chidogo na Mbuli Zinogile zimwenga nhatu. Mbuli Inogile ya Yohana itoma mauzauza yoyasang'hane Yesu na iviya handike ng'hani kusonhela masimwe yake. Na iviya handike mbuli za mana fana viya ubatizo wa Yesu na kugezigwa kuna dibwilingu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeliumo</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Yohana kokwandusa Mbuli Inogile muna 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Kaidi kokwandika kusonhela mauzauza yamwenga yoyasang'hane Yesu muna 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Maabaho kolonga mengi yoyalawilile muna uugima wa Yesu na kokongeza kudanganika kwa Yesu na uzilibuko wake muna 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="ili">4. Kuuhelelo, Yohana kogotola Mbuli Inogile muna isula ya 21 yolonga kusonhela lusita Yesu viyawalawilile kwa wanhu viifosile kuzilibuka kwake na maabaho kolonga lungilo da kwandika chitabu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Baho mwanduso vinhu vose ving'hali havinalumbigwa kukala na imwe yatangigwe Mbuli. Mbuli iyo kakala kwa Mulungu, nayo kakala Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Kusongela mwanduso Mbuli kakala na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Kufosela yeye, Mulungu kalumba vinhu vose, habule chinhu chilumbigwe bila yeye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Mbuli iyo kakala chandusilo cha ugima, na ugima uwo ukala bung'hulo kwa wanhu, <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>bung'hulo ijo domwemwesa mudiziza, na ziza hadidahile bule kudisegeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Mulungu kamtuma msenga wake, munhu iyo zina jake Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Yohana keza kuwalongela wanhu mbuli ya bung'hulo, muladi wanhu wose waihulike na kuihuwila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Yeye mwenyewo hakalile bung'hulo bule, mbali keza kuwalongela wanhu mbuli ya bung'hulo ijo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Dino dikala bung'hulo da kweli, bung'hulo dodikalile dokwiza muna iisi yose na kuwamwemwesela wanhu wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Mbuli kakala mwiisi, na ingawa Mulungu kalumba isi kufosela yeye, mbali habule munhu muna iisi yammanyile bule. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Keza kumwake mwenyewo, mbali wanhu wake hawamuhokele bule. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Mbali wanhu wose wowamuhokele na wowamuhuwile, kaweng'ha udaho wa kuwa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Wana wowelekigwe siyo kwa udaho wa wanhu hebu kwa lukuli hebu kwa udaho wa munhu mbali kwa udaho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ija yoyatangigwe Mbuli kawa munhu, nayo kakala hamwe na cheye. Na cheye chiuwona utunhizo wake, utunhizo wa Mwana Nyachende yoyezile kulawa kwa Tata, kamema utunhizo na ukweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohana kawalongela wanhu mbuli za munhu iyo. Kalandula dizi, “Ino iyo yoniwalongele, ‘Iyo yokwiza kuchisogo changu ni mkulu kufosa niye kwaviya kakala baho niye ning'hali sinakwelekigwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Kwa mvunyo yake ya ubazi, cheye chose chihokela unovu umwe mchanyha ya unovu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Mulungu kaching'ha Malagilizo kufosela Musa, mbali unovu na kweli viza kufosela Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Habule munhu yoyose yoyamuwonile Mulungu. Mbali Mwana Nyachende muhala yeli Mulungu kweli, yeli habehi na Tata, iyo niiyo yoyachitendeze chimmanye Mulungu viyeli.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Masayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliki 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Uno uwo ukalangama wa Yohana, baho walangulizi wa Wayahudi kulawa isi ya Yelusalemu viwawatumile wakulu wa nhoselo na Walawi kuhita kwa Yohana, kumuuza kuwa yeye kakala yelihi.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohana halemile bule, mbali katogola gubulagubula, “Niye sili Chilisito bule yoyasaguligwe na Mulungu kuwakombola wanhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Wamuuza, “Humbe weye kwa yelihi? Weye kwa Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana kawedika, “Mbe, si niye bule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wamuuza kaidi, “Vino weye kwa mulotezi wa Mulungu yoyalongigwe kokwiza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Kawedika, “Si niye bule.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Maabaho wamuuza, “Vino weye mwenyewo koilongaze? Lelo chilongele chikawalongele waja wowachitumile kukuuza. Vino weye mwenyewo koilongaze?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohana kedika kwa kulonga chiya chiyalongile mulotezi wa Mulungu Isaya, “Niye na dizi da munhu dotanga kudibwilingu, ‘Igoloseni nzila ya Mndewa!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Maabaho wasenga wowatumigwe na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>wamuuza Yohana, “One weye huli Chilisito wala Eliya wala mulotezi wa Mulungu, lelo habali kobatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohana kawedika, “Niye nobatiza kwa mazi, mbali mgati mmwenu kaumo imwe hamummanyile bule. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Iyo niiyo yokwiza hachisogo changu. Niye sifaya hata kwiinama na kufungula nzabi za vilatu vake.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Munhu yoyavalile vilatu</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Yano yose yalawilila uko Besaniya, umwambu wa ulwanda lwa Yolodani, Yohana hoyakalile kobatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanang'hondolo wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Siku isondelele Yohana kamuwona Yesu komwizila, kalonga, “Loleni! Mwanang'hondolo wa Mulungu yoyosegeza uhasanyi wa isi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Ino iyo yonilongile mbuli zake vinilongile, ‘Kokwiza munhu kuchisogo changu yeli mkulu kufosa niye kwaviya kakala baho niye ning'hali sina vumbuka.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Niye mwenyewo nikala simmanyile bule, mbali niza kubatiza kwa mazi muladi wanhu wa Isilaeli wammanye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Maabaho Yohana kalava ukalangama uno, “Nimuwona Muhe kohulumuka kulawa kuulanga fana nziwa na kakala uchanyha yake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Niye nikala simmanyile bule, mbali ija yanitumile kubatiza kwa mazi kanilongela, ‘Munhu yondaumuwone Muhe komuhulumukila na kukala mchanyha yake, iyo niiyo yondayabatize kwa Muhe Yelile.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Niye nichiwona chinhu icho, na niye nowalongela kweli, ino iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula wanahina wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Siku isondelele Yohana kakala haja kaidi hamwe na wanahina wake waidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Viyamuwone Yesu kofosa, kalonga, “Loleni! Mwanang'hondolo wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Waja wanahina waidi viwamuhulike Yohana kolonga ivo, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu kahinduka, kawona womuwinza, kawauza, “Vino mwozahila choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wamwidika, “Labi, vino weye kokala kulihi?” Labi fambulo jake mfundiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Kawedika, “Izoni mwizawona.” Ivo wahita na wawona hanhu hayakalile kokala Yesu. Ikala yofika saa longo ichigulogulo. Nawo wakala na Yesu chigulogulo yose.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andeleya, ndugu yake Saimoni Petili kakala imwe wa wanhu waidi wowahulike chiya chiyalongile Yohana na kumuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Bahobaho Andeleya kamuwona Saimoni ndugu yake, kamulongela, “Chimuwona Mulopozi yoyasaguligwe na Mulungu kuwakombola wanhu.” Munhu iyo niiyo Chilisito Mulopozi. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Maabaho Andeleya kamsola Saimoni kamgala kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu kamulola Saimoni, maabaho kalonga, “Weye kwa Saimoni mwana wa Yohana, mbali kwizatangigwa Kefa.” Kefa fambulo jake Petili, Petili fambulo jake luwe.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatanga Filipo na Nasanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Siku isondelele Yesu kailunga kuhita Galilaya. Kamuwona Filipo, kamulongela, “Niwinze!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipo kakala mkaya wa Besisaida, bululu diwakalile wokala Andeleya na Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipo kamuwona Nasanayeli, kamulongela, “Chimuwona ija mbuli zake zandikigwe na Musa muna ichitabu cha Malagilizo, na walotezi wa Mulungu iviya wandika mbuli zake. Niiyo Yesu wa Nazaleti, mwana wa Yosefu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nasanayeli kauza, “Vino yodahika chinhu chochose chinogile chilawe Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo kamwidika, “Izo ulole.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesu viyamuwone Nasanayeli komwizila, kalonga, “Iyo ni Muisilaeli kweli, mgati mmwake mwabule uvwizi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nasanayeli kamuuza, “Vino weye kunimanyaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu kamwidika, “Nikuwona viukalile hasi ya mbiki wa mtini Filipo yang'hali hanakutanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Nasanayeli kedika kalonga, “Mfundiza, weye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu! Weye kwa Mfalume wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Maabaho Yesu kalonga, “Kuhuwila kwaviya nikulongela kuwa nikuwona hasi hana umbiki wa mtini? Kwizawona vinhu vikulu kufosa vino!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela kweli, mwizawona ulanga wogubuka na wasenga wa kuulanga wokwela na kuhulumuka mchanyha mwa Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Dugila da sola uko Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Vizifosile siku nhatu, kukala na dugila da sola mudibululu da Kana, mwiisi ya Galilaya. Mami yake Yesu kakala uko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesu na wanahina wake iviya wakala wagonikigwa kuna didugila ijo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Divai viimalile, mami yake Yesu kamulongela, “Wabule divai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mama, sekeunilongele cha kutenda. Lusita lwangu lung'hali halunafika bule.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Mami yake Yesu kawalongela wasang'hani, “Tendeni chochose chondayamulongeleni.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Baho hakala miziga sita ya mabwe ikigwa mazi kwa ichimu cha chihendo cha Wayahudi cha kunawa nhende. Chila ziga dodaha kumema nongo nne mbaka tano. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu kawalongela wasang'hani, “Memezeni mazi muna imiziga.” Nawo waimemeza neemhu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Maabaho kawalongela, “Lelo deheni yamazi na mumgalile mkulu wa didugila.” Wasang'hani watenda ivo fana viyawalongele. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Mkulu wa didugila kayalanza yamazi, nayo yagaluke divai. Havimanyile bule kuilawile divai ija, mbali wasang'hani wowadehile yamazi wavimanya. Maabaho mkulu ija kamtanga munhu ija yosola hamgwazo, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>kamulongela, “Chila munhu teng'hu kolava divai inogile maabaho wageni wahamala kung'wa ng'hani, baho kolava divai ihile. Mbali weye kuika divai inogile mbaka sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesu katenda chilaguso chino cha mauzauza cha mwanduso uko Kana, muna iisi ya Galilaya. Uko kalagusa utunhizo wake na wanahina wake wamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Viyamalile yayo, Yesu na mami yake hamwe na ndugu zake na wanahina wake wahita Kapelinaumu. Wakala uko kwa siku ndodo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohita Mwiikaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Masayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliki 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Dugila da Wayahudi da Pasaka vidikalile habehi, Yesu kahita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Kawafika wanhu Mwiikaye ya Mulungu wochuuza ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na nziwa na wanhu wamwenga wakala muna ivigoda vawo wokwasakanya hela.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Munhu mchuluza kokwasakanya hela</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Ivo kabota kwangwa da luzabi, kawawinga wose mwiikaye ya Mulungu, hamwe na ng'hondolo na ng'ombe. Iviya kavihindula vipango va wokwasakanya hela na kuzipwililisa hela zawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Maabaho kawalongela waja wakalile wochuuza nziwa, “Segezeni vinhu vino hano! Habali moitenda kaye ya Tati yangu kuwa gulilo?”<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Wanahina wake wakumbuka kuwa yandikigwa muna Yamaandiko Yelile, “Mulungu Ulondo wangu kwa kaye yako wonikoma muumoyo wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Maabaho wakulu wa Wayahudi wamuuza Yesu, “Vino kodaha kutenda chilaguso chaki cha mauzauza kuchilagusa kuwa kunawo udaho wa kutenda yano yose?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ibomoleni Kaye ino ya Mulungu, na niye nizaizenga kaidi kwa siku nhatu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Wayahudi wamuuza, “Kaye ino ya Mulungu izengigwa kwa miyaka malongo mane na sita! Weye kwizaizenga kwa siku nhatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Mbali kaye ya Mulungu iyakalile koilonga Yesu ikala lukuli lwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Ivo viyazilibuke, wanahina wake wakumbuka chila chiyalongile. Maabaho wayatogola Maandiko Yelile na watogola mbuli ziya ziyalongile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaumanya unhu wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesu viyakalile Yelusalemu muna didugila da Pasaka, wanhu wengi wamtogola kwaviya wawona mauzauza yoyatendile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Mbali Yesu hawiye na uhuwilo nawo bule, kwaviya kawamanya wanhu wose. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Iviya halondile bule munhu yoyose yamulongele mbuli za munhu, kwaviya kavimanya yaja yeli mwiimizoyo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Kukala na mkulu imwe wa Wayahudi yoyatangigwe Nikodemo, yoyakalile mwiichibumbila cha Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Chilo chimwe, kamuhitila Yesu, kamulongela, “Mfundiza, chovimanya kuwa weye kwa mfundiza youtumigwe na Mulungu. Habule munhu yoyose yoyodaha kutenda mauzauza youtenda one Mulungu heli hamwe nayo bule.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela kweli, habule munhu yoyodaha kuuwona ufalume wa Mulungu one helekigwe mwanza wekaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemo kamuuza, “Vino munhu mulala kodahaze kwelekigwa kaidi? Vino kodaha kwingila kaidi mwiinda ya mami yake na kwelekigwa?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela kweli, habule munhu yoyodaha kwingila muna Uufalume wa Mulungu bila kwelekigwa kwa mazi na kwa Muhe. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Chochelekigwa na lukuli ni lukuli na chochelekigwa na Muhe ni muhe. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Sekewazanywe kwaviya nokulongela kuwa wose mwolondeka mwelekigwe mwanza wekaidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Beho dohita ubanzi wowose dodilonda. Kotegeleza dizi jake mbali hudimanya kodilawile wala kodihita. Vino ivoili kwa chila munhu yelekigwe na Muhe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemo kamuuza, “Vino mbuli zino zodahikaze?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Weye kwa mfundiza mwiisi ya Isilaeli na huzimanyile bule mbuli zino? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Nokulongela kweli, cholonga vinhu vochivimanyile, iviya cholonga ukalangama wa vinhu vochiviwone, mbali mung'hali mwolema ukalangama wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Vinimulongeleni mbuli za vinhu va isi hamutogole bule, vino mwizatogolaze nihawalongelani mbuli za vinhu va kuulanga?” <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Habule munhu yahitile kuulanga mbali Mwana wa Munhu, yoyezile kulawa kuulanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Fana viya Musa viyachinule chiya chinyago cha zoka da shaba kwa lubiki kuja kudibwilingu, iviya Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yenuligwe <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>muladi chila munhu yoyomtogola yawe na ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Kwaviya Mulungu kawalonda wanhu wa isi yose mbaka kamulava Mwanage nyachende, muladi chila munhu yoyomtogola sekeyadanganike, mbali yawe na ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Mulungu hamtumile Mwanage mwiisi yawataguse wanhu muna isi, mbali kamtuma yawakombole.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Munhu yoyose yoyomtogola hatagusigwa bule, mbali munhu yoyose yoyolema kumtogola iyo katagusigwa kamala, kwaviya hamtogole Mwana nyachende wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Vino ivo vondamutagusigwe, bung'hulo diza muna iisi, mbali wanhu walonda ziza kufosa bung'hulo, kwaviya sang'hano zawo ziha. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Wanhu wose wowotenda yehile wodihila bung'hulo na haweza kwiza mudibung'hulo, kwaviya hawalonda sang'hano zawo zilagusigwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Mbali munhu yoyokala na kutenda yanogile kokwiza kudibung'hulo, muladi sang'hano zake ziwoneke kuwa zisang'hanigwa kwa kumuhulika Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Hamwande Yesu na wanahina wake wahita muna iisi ya Yudeya, uko kakala nawo na kabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yohana iviya kakala kobatiza wanhu uko Ainoni habehi na Salimu, kwaviya uko kukala na mazi mengi. Wanhu wamuhitila, nayo kawabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Siku izo Yohana kakala hanakwikigwa mchifungo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Wanahina wamwenga wa Yohana wandusa kwiihasanya na Muyahudi imwe kwa mbuli ya kuisafya. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Wanahina waja wamuhitila Yohana, wamulongela, “Mfundiza, komkumbuka ija munhu yoyakalile na weye umwambu wa ulwanda lwa Yolodani, ija youchilongele mbuli zake? Lelo kobatiza na wanhu wose womuhitila!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohana kawedika, “Habule munhu yoyodaha kuwa na chinhu one heng'higwe kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Mweye wenyewo mwa wakalangama viniwalongele, ‘Niye sili Chilisito, mbali nitumigwa nimulongolele.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Yeli na msoligwa niiyo msola. Mbwiya wa mulume yosola yokwima na kugozela, nayo kodeng'helela nani yahahulika dizi da mulume yosola. Sambi na niye nodeng'helela, na ndeng'helelo yangu itimia. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Yeye kolondeka yawe mkulu, niye nolondeka kuwa mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yoyolawa kuulanga ni mkulu kufosa wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Munhu yokwiza kulawa kuulanga mkulu kufosa wose. Munhu wa isi ni wa chiisiisi, nayo kolonga mbuli za isi. Mbali munhu yalawile kuulanga mkulu kufosa vose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Yeye kolonga yaja yaawone na yaahulike, mbali habule munhu yoyatogole mbuli ziyalongile. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Munhu yoyose yotogola usenga wake, kothibitisha kuwa Mulungu iyo kweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Yoyatumigwe na Mulungu kolonga mbuli za Mulungu, kwaviya Mulungu kammemeza Muhe wake. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Tata kamulonda Mwanage na kamwing'ha chila chinhu mmakono yake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Munhu yoyose yoyomtogola Mwana kana ugima wa siku zose, mbali yoyose yoyomulema Mwana hezawona ugima bule, kwaviya ludoko lwa Mulungu lwizakuwa kwa munhu iyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mwanamke Msamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Kwa ivo Mndewa viyahulike Mafalisayo wahulika kuwa Yesu kopata wanahina wengi na kubatiza kumfosa Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Hata ivo Yesu mwenyewo habatize wanhu bule mbali wanahina wake muhala. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesu viyahulike ivo, kasegela Yudeya na kabwela kaidi Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Muna umwanza wake kalondeka yafosele Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Kafika muna dibululu da Samaliya, hanhu hatangigwe Sikali, habehi na mgunda wa Yakobo uyamwing'hile Yosefu mwanage. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Hanhu haja hakala na chisima cha Yakobo. Ivo Yesu kakala hasi habehi na chisima icho kwaviya kakala kalegela kwa umwanza. Lusita uwo ikala saa sita imisi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Mwanamke imwe wa Chisamaliya keza kudeha mazi. Yesu kamulongela, “Uning'he mazi ning'we!” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Wanahina wake wakala wahita kudibululu kugula ndiya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Mwanamke ija kamwidika, “Weye kwa Muyahudi na niye na Msamaliya. Vilihi konipula mazi ya kung'wa?” Kwaviya Wayahudi hawaihanganya hamwe bule na Wasamaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu kamwidika, “One uvimanyile chinhu choyolava Mulungu, na one iviya uvimanyile yelihi yokupula mazi ya kung'wa, uhampulile yeye, nayo yahakwing'hile mazi ya Ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Mwanamke ija kalonga, “Mwenevale, weye kwabule doo da kudehela, na chisima chingila. Lelo kulihi kondaupate mazi ya Ugima? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Vino weye kwa mkulu kufosa tati yetu Yakobo? Yeye mwenyewo na wanage hamwe na wanyama wake wang'wa mazi ya chisima chino!”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu yoyose yong'wa mazi yano kezawona ng'hilu kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Mbali munhu yoyose yonda yang'we mazi yonimwing'ha niye, hezawona ng'hilu kaidi bule. Kwaviya mazi yonimwing'ha niye yezakuwa nzasa yoilava mazi ya Ugima mgati mmwake, na yezamwing'ha ugima wa siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Mwenevale, ning'he mazi yayo muladi sekeniwone ng'hilu na wala sekenize hano kudeha mazi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Hita kamtange mulumako wize nayo hano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Mwanamke ija kamwidika, “Nabule mulume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu kamulongela, “Kulonga goya viulongile kwabule mulume. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Kwaviya kusoligwa na walume watano, na mulume yuuli nayo sambi si mulumako bule. Kunilongela kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Mwenevale, nowona weye kwa mulotezi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Wasaho zetu wamtosela Mulungu muna ulugongo luno, mbali mweye Wayahudi mwolonga chilondeka kumtosela Mulungu uko Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mama nitogole, lusita lwokwiza wanhu hawezamtosela Tata muna ulugongo luno wala uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Mweye Wasamaliya mwotosela chiya hamchimanyile, mbali cheye Wayahudi chomtosela Mulungu yochimmanyile, na kwa cheye Wayahudi, Mulungu kawakombola wanhu wose muna iisi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Mbali chipindi chokwiza, na sambi chifika wanhu wowotosa muna ikweli wezamtosela Tata muna Umuhe na kweli, kwaviya wanhu wawo niiyo wawo Tata yoowazahila. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Mulungu ni Muhe, wanhu wake wowomtosela wolondeka kumtosela kwa Muhe na kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Novimanya Chilisito Mulopozi kokwiza, na vondayeze kezachilongela chila chinhu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Niye yonilonga na weye niiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Wanahina wake wabwela na wazanywa ng'hani kumfika Yesu kolonga na mwanamke. Mbali habule munhu yamuuzile kuwa mwanamke ija kolonda choni, hebu kumuuza Yesu habali kolonga na mwanamke.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Maabaho mwanamke kaileka nongo yake ya mazi, kabwela kudibululu, kawalongela wanhu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Izoni mumuwone munhu yoyanilongele vinhu vose vinitendile. Vino ino kodaha kuwa Chilisito?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Ivo wanhu walawa kudibululu, wamuhitila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Lusita luja luja wanahina wake wamulamba Yesu, “Mfundiza, teng'hu diya!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Mbali Yesu kawedika, “Niye ninayo ndiya yohamuimanyile bule.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Maabaho wanahina wake wandusa kwiiuzagiza wenyewo, “Vino kuna munhu wowose yoyamgalile ndiya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ndiya yangu iyo ino, kutenda viyolonda Mulungu na kukomeleza sang'hano yake yoyaning'hile kuitenda. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Vino mweye hamulonga, ‘Ing'hali miyezi mine mbaka chipindi cha kugobola chifike?’ Nowalongela, inuleni yameso yenu mulole migunda! Ndiya zikangala na zolondeka kugoboligwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Munhu yogobola ndiya kumgunda kezalihigwa, na kokwika hamwe ndiya kwa ugima wa siku zose. Maabaho munhu yohanda na munhu yogobola wezadeng'helela hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Ivo ulonzi ulonga kweli, ‘Imwe kohanda mbeyu, na imwenga kogobola ndiya.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nimtumani kugobola ndiya hamuzihandile bule. Wanhu wamwenga wasang'hana, na mweye momweda kwa sang'hano yawo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Wasamaliya wengi wa dibululu diya wamuhuwila Yesu kwaviya mwanamke ija kalonga, “Kanilongela vinhu vose vonitendile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Ivo Wasamaliya viwamuhitile Yesu wamulamba yakale nawo, Yesu kakala nawo siku mbili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Wanhu wengi wamuhuwila Yesu kwa ichimu cha mbuli yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Wamulongela mwanamke ija, “Sambi chohuwila, si kwa chila chiulongile weye. Cheye wenyewo chimtegeleza, na chovimanya munhu ino kweli ni Mulopozi wa isi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mwana wa mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Vizifosile siku mbili, Yesu kahita Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Kwaviya Yesu mwenyewo kalonga mulotezi wa Mulungu hatogoligwa bule muna iisi yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Wanhu wa Galilaya wakala wahita mudidugila da Pasaka uko Yelusalemu, na wawona yose yatendigwe na Yesu muna didugila ijo. Ivo Yesu viyafikile Galilaya, wanhu wa Galilaya wamuhokela.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Maabaho Yesu kahita kaidi Kana muna isi ya Galilaya, hanhu hayagaluse mazi kuwa divai. Baho hakala mkulu imwe yeli na mwana mtamu uko Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Mkulu iyo viyahulike Yesu kafika muna iisi ya Galilaya kulawa Yudeya, kamulamba Yesu yahite Kapelinaumu yakamuhonye mwanage yoyakalile habehi kudanganika. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kumwenu habule munhu yoyodaha kutogola mbaka yawone vilaguso na mauzauza.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Mkulu ija kamwidika, “Mwenevale, chihite sambi mwanangu yang'hali hanadanganika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Hita, mwanago kezahona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mkulu ija kahuwila mbuli za Yesu, ivo kahita. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Viyakalile mwiinzila, kaiting'hana na watumwa wake, wamulongela, “Mwanago kahona!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Nayo kawauza lusita luyahonile mwanage, watumigwa wamwidika, “Utamu umulawa igolo ifosile saa saba imisi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Maabaho tata iyo kakumbuka lukala lusita luja luja Yesu viyamulongele, “Mwanago kezahona.” Ivo yeye hamwe na kaye yake yose wamuhuwila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Chino chikala chilaguso cha mauzauza chekaidi chiyatendile Yesu viyalawile Yudeya kuhita Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Hamwande Yesu kahita Yelusalemu kuna didugila da Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Uko Yelusalemu, habehi na ulwivi lukulu lwa ng'hondolo kukala na lamba doditangigwa kwa Chiyebulaniya Betisaza, najo dikala na vihelengo vitano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Wanhu wengi wowakalile watamu wakala watambalala muvihelengo ivo. Vipofu na mbetembete na wanhu wowaholole. Wakala wogozela yamazi yatibuligwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Kwaviya lusita lumwenga msenga wa kuulanga kohulumuka na kwingila muna dilamba na kuyatibula yamazi. Mtamu yokwandusa kwingila munayamazi viyatibuke, kakala kohonyigwa utamu wowose uyakalile nawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Haja hakala na munhu yakalile kolumwa kwa lusita lwa miyaka malongo matatu na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu viyamuwone mtamu ija katambalala haja, kavimanya kuwa kakala mtamu kwa siku nyingi. Ivo kamuuza, “Vino weye kolonda kuhona?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Mtamu ija kamwidika, “Mwenevale, nabule munhu wa kunika muna dilamba lusita yahatibuligwa. Chila honilonda kwingila, munhu imwenga konilongolela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Maabaho Yesu kamulongela, “Inuka! Sola lili jako uhite.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Bahobaho mtamu ija kahonyigwa, kasola lili jake, kahita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Chinhu icho chilawilila muna Isiku ya Mhumulo, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>ivo walangulizi wa Wayahudi wamulongela munhu ija yoyahonyigwe, “Diyelo ni Isiku ya Mhumulo. Malagilizo yetu yolema munhu yoyose kupapa lili muna dizuwa dino.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Mbali munhu iyo kawedika, “Munhu yoyanihonyile kanilongela, ‘Sola lili jako uhite.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Wamuuza kaidi, “Yelihi yoyakulongele usole lili jako uhite?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Mbali hammanyile bule munhu yoyamuhonyile kakala yelihi, kwaviya wanhu wakala wengi, na Yesu kakala yasegele.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Hamwande Yesu kahita muna ikaye ya kumpulila Mulungu, kamuwona munhu ija, kamulongela, “Tegeleza, sambi kuhona. Leka kutenda uhasanyi hebu chinhu chihile nani chizakupata.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Maabaho munhu ija kasegela na kawalongela walangulizi wa Wayahudi kuwa yoyamuhonyile kakala Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ivo kwaviya Yesu katenda chinhu icho muna Isiku ya Mhumulo, Wayahudi wandusa kumwihila. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Tati yangu kosanana usang'hano lusita lwose, iviya niye nolondeka nisanane.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Wayahudi walonda wamkome Yesu kwaviya kahasanya Malagilizo ya Isiku ya Mhumulo, na kwaviya kamtanga Mulungu Tati yake, ivo kaitenda kalinga Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, Mwana wa Mulungu hadaha kutenda chinhu chochose yaidumwe. Kodaha kutenda chiya muhala chiyamuwonile Tati yake kochitenda, kwaviya chochose chiyotenda Tata, iviya Mwana kochitenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Kwaviya Tata komulonda Mwana na komulagusa yose yoyoyatenda. Kezamulagusa vinhu vikulu kufosa vino, na mweye wose mwizakwazanywa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Saviya Tata viyowazlilibula wanhu wowadanganike na kuwena ugima, iviya Mwana kowena ugima wanhu woyowalonda. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Tata hamtagusa munhu yoyose bule, mbali kamwing'ha Mwanage udaho wa kutagusa, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ivo wanhu wose wamuhulike Mwana fana viwomuhulika Tata. Munhu yoyose yoyolema kumuhulika Mwana, komulema Tata yoyamtumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli yangu na kumuhuwila ija yoyanitumile, kana ugima wa siku zose. Hezatagusigwa kwaviya kafosa muna iifa na kwingila muna uugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Nowalongela kweli, lusita lokwiza, na sambi lufika wanhu wowadanganike vondawahulike dizi da Mwana wa Mulungu, na waja wose wondawadihulike wezakuwa wagima. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Fana Tata mwenyewo viyeli mwanduso wa ugima, iviya kamtenda Mwana kuwa mwanduso wa ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Kamwing'ha Mwana udaho wa kutagusa kwaviya ni Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Sekemwazanywe na chino, lusita lokwiza wanhu wowadanganike wezahulika dizi jake. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Nawo wezalawa muna yamaleme yawo, waja watendile yanogile wezazilibuligwa na kukala wagima, mbali waja watendile yehile wezazilibuligwa na kutagusigwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukalangama wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Niye mwenyewo sidaha bule kutenda chinhu chochose, ila notagusa fana Mulungu viyanilongele, ivo nhaguso yangu ni ya haki. Sitenda viya vinilonda niye, mbali notenda viya viyolonda ija yoyanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“One nihalonga mbuli zangu mwenyewo, ukalangama wangu wa uvwizi. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Kauko imwenga yoyolonga mbuli zangu, na niye novimanya chila chinhu chiyolonga ni cha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Mweye muwatuma wanhu kwa Yohana, nayo kawalongela mbuli za kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Niye silonda ukalangama wa munhu, mbali nolonga vino muladi mweye mukomboligwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohana kakala fana chitasa chikalile chikwaka na kulava bung'hulo, na mweye musagula lusita ludodo kudenelela bung'hulo jake. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Mbali niye nina ukalangama mkulu kufosa ukalangama uyalavile Yohana. Kwaviya usang'hano uyaninile Tata niukomeleze, usang'hano woniutenda wolagusa kuwa Tata kanituma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Tata mwenyewo, iyo yanhumile kolonga mbuli zangu. Hamunawahi bule kuhulika dizi jake wala kuwona chihanga chake lusita lwolwose. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Iviya hamuhuwila mbuli yake bule kwaviya hammuhuwile bule ija yoyamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Moyasoma yamandiko kwaviya mogesa muna iyayo mwizapata ugima wa siku zose. Maandiko Yelile yayo yolonga mbuli zangu, <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>mbali mung'hali molema kwiza kumwangu na kuwa na ugima!<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Silonda bule wanhu wanitunhize, <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>mbali nowamanya. Nomanya kuwa mwabule ulondo wa Mulungu muna imizoyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Niza kwa udaho wa Tati yangu, hamunihokele bule, mbali munhu imwenga yaheza kwa udaho wake, mwizamuhokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Molonda kuitunhiza wenyewo, wala hamuzahila bule kutunhizigwa na Mulungu yaidumwe! Vino mwizadahaze kunihuwila? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Sekemgese kuwa niye nizamulongelezani kwa Tata. Musa, iyo mweye mumulolela iyo yondayamulongelezeni. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>One momuhuwila Musa, muhanihuwile na niye, kwaviya yeye kazandika mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Mbali one hamuhuwila chiya choyandike Musa, mwizadahaze kuhuwila chiya chinilonga niye?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndiya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Masayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliki 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Hamwande Yesu kahita umwambu wa lamba da Galilaya, hebu lamba ditangigwa da Tibeliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Lung'husesa lukulu lwa wanhu lumsondelela kwaviya wawona vilaguso viyatendile va kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Maabaho Yesu kakwela mchanyha kuna ulugongo, kakala hamwe na wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Dugila da Pasaka ya Wayahudi dikala habehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesu viyawonile lung'husesa lukulu lwa wanhu longendela, kamuuza Filipo, “Chigule kulihi ndiya ya kuja wanhu wano wose?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Yesu kalonga ivo kwa kungeza Filipo kwaviya kavimanya chiya chondayatende.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo kamwidika Yesu, “Magate ya hela magana maidi hazifaya bule hata ihawa chila imwe yahapata chihande chidodo muhala!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Mwanahina imwe wa Yesu yoyatangigwe Andeleya, ndugu yake Saimoni Petili kamulongela Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Kabahano mbwanga kanavo vigate vitano va uhemba na visomba vidi. Mbali icho choni kwa wanhu wengi fana wano!”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina wake, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale hasi.” Hanhu haja hakala na savu dimema. Ivo wanhu wose wakala hasi. Walume muhala wowakalile muna ulung'husesa luja peta yawo ikala magana malongo matano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Maabaho Yesu kavisola vigate viya, kamwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu na kaweng'ha wanhu wowakalile hasi. Iviya katenda viya viya kwa ivisomba. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Wanhu wose viwegute, Yesu kawalongela wanahina wake, “Soleni masigavu muladi sekechage chinhu chochose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Ivo wanahina wadondola na kumemeza vigelo longo na vidi va masigavu ya vigate va uhemba vovisigazigwe na wanhu wadile.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Wanhu viwawonile mauzauza yoyatendigwe na Yesu, wandusa kulonga, “Kweli ino iyo mulotezi wa Mulungu yokwiza muna isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu kavimanya wanhu wailungila kwiza wamtende mfalume kwa nguvu, kawabanga, kahita kuna ulugongo yaidumwe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogenda mchanyha ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Masayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliki 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Zua vidishwile, wanahina wake wahulumuka mbaka kuidilamba. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Wakwela mwiingalawa wadahe kuloka dilamba kuhita Kapelinaumu. Lwiza lukala lutanda, na Yesu kakala yang'hali kuwafikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Beho kulu dikala dobuma na mazi yatibuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Wanahina viwakalile wahita fana ugenzi wa saa dimwe, wamuwona Yesu kogenda mchanyha ya mazi, kokwiza habehi na ingalawa. Wanahina wadumba nani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Ni niye! Sekemudumbe!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Maabaho walonda kumwingiza Yesu muna ingalawa, bahobaho ngalawa ifika hanhu hana iisi inyalile.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu womzahila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Siku isondelele, lung'husesa lwa wanhu wowakalile umwambu wa dilamba wavimanya kuja kukala na ngalawa imwe muhala. Iviya wavimanya kuwa Yesu hengile bule muna ingalawa hamwe na wanahina wake, mbali wanahina wasegela waidumwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Maabaho ngalawa zimwenga zilawile Tibeliya zifika habehi na hanhu haja wanhu howadile magate Mndewa viyakomeleze kumwina hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Viwawonile kuwa Yesu na wanahina wake wakala wasegela, wakwela ngalawa na kuhita Kapelinaumu kunzahila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiya ya ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Wanhu viwamuwonile Yesu umwambu wa dilamba, wamuuza, “Mfundiza, vino kufika zuwaki hano?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela kweli, mweye monizahila siyo kwaviya muwona chilaguso, mbali kwaviya muja magate na mwiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Sekemugaiye ndiya yoiwola, mbali gaiyeni ndiya yoikala siku zose. Ndiya ino iyo Mwana wa Munhu kezawena, kwaviya Mulungu kamtogolela kutenda ivo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Maabaho wamuuza Yesu, “Vino chitende choni muladi chitende chiya Mulungu choyochilonda chitende?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu kawedika, “Chino icho choyolonda Mulungu muchitende, mumuhuwile ija yoyamtumile.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Wamuuza, “Vino chilaguso chilihi choudaha kuchitenda muladi chikuhuwile? Vino kwizatendaze? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Wasaho zetu waja mana uko kudibwilingu, fana viyandikigwe muna Yamaandiko, ‘Kawena gate dodilawile kuulanga waje.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongelani kweli, siyo Musa yawinileni ndiya ija ya kuulanga. Tati yangu iyo yamwinileni ndiya ya kweli yoilawile kuulanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Kwaviya ndiya yoyochina Mulungu ni munhu ija yokwiza kulawa kuulanga na kuwea ugima wanhu weli muisi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Wamulongela, “Mwenevale, uchine ndiya ino siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Maabaho Yesu kawalongela, “Niye na ndiya ya ugima. Wanhu wowokwiza kumwangu hawezawona nzala bule, na wanhu wowonihuwila hawezawona nilu bule. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Mbali fana vinimulongeleni, muniwona mbali hamunihuwile bule. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Wose wowonina Tata, wezakwiza kumwangu, na yoyose yokwiza kumwangu, sizamwasa kunze bule. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Kwaviya niye niza kulawa kuulanga siyo kutenda vinilonda niye, mbali kutenda viyolonda ija yoyanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Nayo yoyanitumile kolonda vino, ndeke kumwagiza munhu yoyose muna iwanhu waja woyaninile, mbali niwazilibule wose muna isiku ya uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Kwaviya choyolonda Tati yangu icho chino, chila munhu yoyomulola Mwana na kumuhuwila yawe na ugima wa siku zose, na niye nizanzilibula muna isiku ya uhelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Wayahudi wandusa kulongelela kwaviya Yesu kalonga, “Niye iyo ndiya yoihumuluke kulawa kuulanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Walonga, “Vino ino siyo Yesu mwanage Yosefu bule? Vino tati yake na mami yake hachiwamanyile bule? Lelo kodahaze kulonga, ‘Nihumuluka kulawa kuulanga?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Lekeni kulongelela. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Habule munhu yoyodaha kwiza kumwangu one Tata yoyanitumile hamtendile yalonde kwiza kumwangu. Nayo yoyokwiza, nizanzilibula muna isiku ya uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Walotezi wa Mulungu wandika, ‘Wanhu wose wezafundizigwa na Mulungu.’ Na yoyose yoyomuhulika Tata na kuifunza kumwake kezakwiza kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Habule munhu yoyamuwonile Tata mbali imwe yoyalawile kwa Mulungu, yeye yaidumwe iyo yamuwonile Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yonihuwila niye kanawo ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Niye ni ndiya ya ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Wasaho zenu waja mana kuja kudibwilingu, mbali wadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Mbali ino ni ndiya yoihulumuka kulawa kuulanga, munhu yoyose yondayaije sekeyadanganike. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Niye nandiya ya ugima yoihulumuka kulawa kuulanga. One munhu yoyose yahaja ndiya ino, kezakuwa ngima siku zose. Ndiya ino ni lukuli lwangu lunilulava kwa sama ya ugima wa wanhu wa isi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Baho Wayahudi wandusa kuiuzagiza kwa ludoko, “Vino munhu ino kodahaze kuchigha lukuli lwake chije?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, one hamudile lukuli lwa Mwana wa Munhu na kuing'wa damu yake, hamwizakuwa na ugima mgati mmwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Munhu yoyose yoja lukuli lwangu na kuing'wa damu yangu, iyo kanawo ugima wa siku zose, na niye nizanzilibula muna isiku ya uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Kwaviya lukuli lwangu ni ndiya ya kweli na damu yangu ni ching'waji cha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Munhu yoyose yoja lukuli lwangu na kuing'wa damu yangu, iyo kokala mgati mmwangu na niye nokala mgati mmwake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Fana viya Tata yeli mgima viyanitumile, na niye nina ugima kwa sama ya Tata. Ivo munhu yoyose yoja lukuli lwangu kezakala ngima kwa sama ya niye. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Ino ni ndiya yoihumuluke kulawa kuulanga siyo fana imana iwadile wasaho zenu, maabaho wadanganika. Mbali munhu yoyose yoja ndiya ino kana ugima wa siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesu kalonga ivo viyakalile kofundiza muna ikaye ya kutosela uko Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za ugima wa siku zose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Wengi mwa iwanahina wake viwahulike, walonga, “Mafundizo yano madala. Vino yelihi yoyodaha kuyamanya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu kavimanya bila ya kulongiligwa na munhu kuwa wanahina wake wakala wolongelela. Ivo kawauza, “Mafundizo yano yowatenda muwe na mkangagile? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Izakuwaze one mwizamuwona Mwana wa Munhu kobwela kuulanga hanhu hayakalile mwanduso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Muhe wa Mulungu kolava ugima, lukuli lwa munhu haludaha chinhu bule. Mbuli zoniwalongele ni mbuli za Muhe wa Mulungu yowagalila ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Mbali wamwenga wenu mung'hali mwolema kunitogola.” Yesu kalonga vino kwaviya kavimanya kusongela mwanduso welihi mwa iwawo wolema kutogola na munhu yelihi yondayambiduke. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Lekamana niwalongela habule munhu yoyodaha kwiza kumwangu mbaka Tata yamtende yadahe kwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Kusongela siku ijo, wanahina wake wengi wabwela kuchisogo na hawamsondelele bule. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Maabaho Yesu kawauza waja wanahina wake longo na waidi, “Vino na mweye iviya mwolonda kusegela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Saimoni Petili kamwidika, “Mndewa, chihite kwa yelihi? Weye kunazo mbuli za ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Chohuwila na chovimanya weye kwa Yelile ulawile kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino simsaguleni mweye longo na waidi? Mbali imwe wenu mwihi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yesu kakala kolonga kumsonhela Yuda, mwana wa Saimoni Isikaliyoti, imwe wa wanahina longo na waidi. Hamwande Yuda iyo yoyambiduke Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Hamwende Yesu kahita Galilaya. Halondile kuhita Yudeya kwaviya walangulizi wa Wayahudi wakala wolonda kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Lusita lwa dugila da Vizewe da Wayahudi dikala habehi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Ndugu zake wamulongela, “Kwolondeka usegele hano uhite Yudeya muladi wanahina wako wawone mauzauza youtenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Habule munhu yotenda mbuli kwa kuifisa one kolonda yamanyike kwa wanhu. Ivo kwaviya na weye kotenda vinhu vino, ilaguse kwa wanhu weli muisi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Kwaviya mbaka ndugu zake Yesu hawamtogole bule.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Lusita lwangu lufaya lung'hali halunafika bule, mbali kumwenu mweye chila lusita lufaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Wanhu weli muna isi yose hawamwihilani, mbali wonihila niye kwaviya nogendelela kuwalongela kuwa wotenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Mweye hiteni kudidugila. Niye sihita bule kudidugila kwaviya lusita lwangu lufaya halunafika bule.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Yesu kalonga ivo, maabaho kasigala Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuna didugila da vizewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ndugu zake viwahitile kudidugila, Yesu nayo kahita, mbali hahitile chiumwingi, kahita chinyelenyele. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Walangulizi wa Wayahudi wakala wonzahila kuna didugila ijo. Ivo wauza, “Vino kakulihi munhu ija?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Kukala na minyong'onyo muna ulung'husesa lwa wanhu. Wanhu wamwenga wakala wolonga, “Munhu ino kanoga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Wamwenga walonga, “Mbe! Kowagiza wanhu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Mbali habule munhu yoyadahile kulonga mbuli zake muumwingi, kwaviya wakala wawadumba walangulizi wa Chiyahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Dugila ijo vidifikile haludonho, Yesu nayo kahita Mwiikaye ya Mulungu na kandusa kufundiza. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Walangulizi wa Wayahudi wazanywa, wauza, “Vino munhu ino kayamaze yano yose nayo hasomile bule kuishule?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mafundizo yonifundiza siyo yangu bule mbali yolawa kwa ija yanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Munhu yoyose yolonda kutenda yaja yoyolonda Mulungu, kezavimanya fana mafundizo yangu yalawa kwa Mulungu hebu nolonga kwa udaho wangu mwenyewo. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Munhu yolonga mbuli zake mwenyeo kolonda utunhizo wake. Mbali munhu yolonda ukulu kwa ija yoyamtumile, iyo ni mwaminifu, na kabule wihi mgati mmwake. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Vino Musa hamwinileni malagilizo bule? Mbali habule hata imwe wenu yoyokwamha. Lelo habali molonda kunikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Lung'husesa lwa wanhu lumulongela, “Weye kuna chinyamkela! Yelihi yoyolonda kukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nitenda mauzauza, mweye wose mukala mwazanywa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Musa kawalagiliza mweye mutende chihendo cha kuwengiza ulungwana wanenu wa chilume, ingawa si Musa bule, mbali wasaho zenu wawo wanduse. Ivo na mweye momwingiza ulungwana mwana wa chilume hata muna Isiku ya Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>One mumwingiza ulungwana mwana muna Isiku ya Mhumulo muladi sekembene Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa, habali monihila kwaviya nimuhonya munhu muna Isiku ya Mhumulo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Sekemutaguse kwa kulola kwa kunze muhala, mbali taguseni viilondeka.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vino ino iyo Chilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Wanhu wamwenga wa Yelusalemu wandusa kuiuzagiza, “Vino munhu wowomzahila wamkome siyo ino? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Lola lelo! Kabahano, kolonga muumwingi na habule munhu yoyomulongela chinhu chochose. Vino walangulizi wovimanya kuwa kweli iyo ni Chilisito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Mbali chovimanya munhu ino kolawa kulihi. Chilisito vondayeze habule munhu yoyose yondayamanye koyolawa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesu viyakalile kofundiza mwiikaye ya Mulungu, kalandula dizi, “Mwonimanya na mwomanya kunhu kunilawa. Sizile kwa udaho wangu mwenyewo. Ija yoyanitumile ni wa kweli. Mbali mweye hamummanyile bule. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Niye nommanya kwaviya nilawa kumwake, nayo iyo yoyanhumile.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Maabaho wanhu walonda kumgwila, mbali habule munhu yoyose yagezile kumgwila kwaviya lusita lwake lukala halunafika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Mbali wanhu wengi muna ulung'husesa wamuhuwila, walonga, “Vino Chilisito vondayeze kezatenda mauzauza mengi kufosa munhu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalizi watumigwa kumgwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Mafalisayo wahulika lung'husesa wonyong'onya mbuli za Yesu. Ivo wawo na wakulu wa nhambiko wawatuma wakalizi wa kaye ya Kutosela wangwile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ning'hali na mweye kwa lusita ludodo, maabaho nizahita kwa ija yoyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Mwizanizahila mbali hamwizaniwona bule, kwaviya hamwizadaha bule kwiza hanhu hanili.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Walangulizi wa Wayahudi wailongela, “Vino munhu ino kezahita kulihi mbaka cheye sekechimuwone? Vino kezahita muna yamabululu ya Wagiliki yowokala wanhu wetu na kuwafundiza Wagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Kalonga kuwa, chizanzahila mbali hachizamuwona, na iviya hachidaha bule kuhita hanhu hayeli. Vino mbuli zino fambulo jake choni?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwanda lwa mazi ya Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Siku ya uhelelo ya dugila ijo dodikalile siku ng'hulu ya dugila, Yesu kema, kalandula dizi, “Munhu yoyose yeli na nilu, nayeze kumwangu yang'we! <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Munhu yoyose yoyonihuwila niye, Maandiko Yelile yolonga, ‘Nyanda za mazi ya Ugima zizakilima kulawa mgati yake.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesu viyakalile kolonga ivo, kakala kolonga mbuli za Muhe wa Mulungu, ija wanhu wowakalile womuhuwila wezamuhokela. Mbaka siku diya, wanhu wakala wang'hali hawanakwing'higwa Muhe wa Mulungu kwaviya Yesu kakala yang'hali kutunhizigwa bule.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu viweli woibagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Wanhu wamwenga muna ulung'husesa viwamuhulike kolonga ivo, walonga, “Munhu ino kweli ni ija imulotezi wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Wanhu wamwenga walonga, “Ino iyo Chilisito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Mbali wanhu wamwenga walonga, “Vino Chilisito kodahaze kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Maandiko Yelile yolonga kuwa Chilisito kezalawilila mulukolo lwa Daudi na kwelekigwa uko Betelehemu, muna dibululu dayakalile Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Ivo wanhu muna ulung'husesa waibagula kwaajili ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Wanhu wamwenga walonda wangwile, mbali habule munhu yoyagolose mkono wake kumgwila.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walangulizi wa Wayahudi wolema kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Wakalizi wa Kaye ya Mulungu viwabwelile, wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo wawauza, “Habali hamumgalile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Wakalizi wawedika, “Habule munhu yoyose yoyalongile fana viyolonga munhu ino!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Mafalisayo wawauza, “Vino na mweye iviya kamvwizilani? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Vino mumuwona mulangulizi yoyose hebu Mfalisayo yoyose yoyomuhuwila? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Wanhu wano hawamanyile bule Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa, ivo waduwiligwa na Mulungu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodemo, imwe wa Mafalisayo, munhu ija yoyamuhitile Yesu baho umwaka kauza, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Vino Malagilizo yetu yochilongela chimtaguse munhu ching'hali hachinamtegeleza teng'hu na kumanya chiyotenda?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Mbali wawo wamwidika, “Vino na weye iviya kolawa Galilaya? Lola muna Yamaandiko Yelile kwizavimanya kuwa habule mulotezi wa Mulungu yolawilila Galilaya bule.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Maabaho chila munhu kahita ukaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Mwanamke yoyagwiligwe ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Mbali Yesu kahita kuna ulugongo lwa Mizaituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Siku isondelele imitootondo nani, Yesu kahita kaidi muna ikaye ya Mulungu. Wanhu wose wamuhitila, nayo kakala hasi, kandusa kuwafundiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Wafundiza Malagilizo na Mafalisayo wamgala mwanamke yoyagwiligwe ugoni. Maabaho wamwika mwanamke iyo hagati. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Wamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, mwanamke ino kagwiligwa ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Muna Yamalagilizo, Musa kachilongela kuwa mwanamke fana ino kolondeka yatowigwe na mabwe mbaka yadanganike. Lelo weye kwolongaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Wauza vino muladi wangeze Yesu muladi wapate chimu cha kumshitaka. Mbali Yesu kaidulika hasi, kandika muna ditimbwisi kwa chidole chake.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Nawo viwagendelele kumuuza, kenuka, kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yelibule uhasanyi vimwili na yawe wa mwanduso kumtowa dibwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Maabaho kaidulika hasi kaidi, kandika muna ditimbwisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Wanhu waja viwahulike ivo, wasegela imwe-imwe, kwandusila walala. Yesu kasigala, na mwanamke ija kakala kema haja haja. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesu kenuka, kamuuza mwanamke ija, “Wakulihi wanhu waja wowakugwilile? Habule hata imwe yoyakutaguse?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Mwanamke ija kamwidika, “Mndewa, habule munhu yoyanitaguse.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu kamulongela, “Niye iviya sikutagusa bule. Hita na sekeukatende uhasanyi kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bung'hulo da isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu kawalongela kaidi Mafalisayo, “Niye ni bung'hulo da isi. Munhu yoyose yoyonisondelela niye kezakuwa na bung'hulo na hezagenda muna ulwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Mafalisayo wamulongela, “Weye kwoilavila ukalangama wako mwenyewo, kwa ivo chiulonga siyo kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hata one nihailavila ukalangama mwenyewo, ukalangama wangu ni wa kweli, kwaviya nimanya kunilawile na kunihita. Mbali mweye hamumanyile kunilawile hebu kunihita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mwotagusa fana wanhu viwotagusa. Niye simtagusa munhu yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Mbali nahatagusa, notagusa viilondeka, kwaviya sitagusa niidumwe. Tata yanhumile kahamwe na niye. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Yandikigwa muna Yamalagilizo yenu kuwa, ukalangama wa wanhu waidi ni wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Niye noilavila ukalangama mwenyewo, na Tata yoyanitumile iviya konilavila ukalangama.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Maabaho wamuuza, “Tati yako kakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu kawedika, “Hamunimanyile niye wala Tati yangu. One muhanimanyile niye, na Tati yangu muhammanyile iviya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu kalonga mbuli zino zose viyakalile kofundiza mwiikaye ya Mulungu, muna ichiheleto cha ngama. Wala habule munhu yangwilile, kwaviya lusita lwake lukala lung'hali halunafika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamudaha kuhita hanhu honihita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesu kawalongela kaidi, “Niye nohita, na mweye mwizanizahila, na mwizadanganika muna uhasanyi wenu. Hamudaha kuhita hanhu honihita.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Walangulizi wa Wayahudi walonga, “Kalonga kuwa hachidaha kuhita hanhu hoyohita. Vino kolonda yaikome mwenyewo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Mbali Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mwa wanhu wa isi ino yili hasi, mbali niye nilawa uchanyha. Mweye ni wa isi ino mbali niye siyo wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Nimulongelani kuwa mwizadanganika muna uhasanyi wenu. One hamutogole kuwa ‘Niye Niiyo’ mwizadanganika muna uhasanyi wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Wamuuza, “Weye iyo yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu kawedika, “Niye ni ija yoniwalongele kusongela mwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ninayo mengi ya kulonga kusonhela mweye na kuwatagusa. Mbali ija yoyanhumile ni kweli, na niye nowalongela wanhu wa isi ino yaja yoniyahulike kumwake muhala.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Hawamanyile kuwa Yesu kakala kowalongela mbuli za Tati yake. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Ivo Yesu kawalongela, “Vondamumwinule Mwana wa Munhu mumsalaba, baho mwizavimanya kuwa Niye Niiyo. Iviya mwizamanya kuwa niye sitenda chochose kwa udaho wangu, mbali nolonga chiyanifundize Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Nayo yoyanhumile kahamwe na niye, hanilekile niidumwe bule kwaviya siku zose notenda yaja yoyomnogeza yeye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Wanhu wengi wowamuhulike Yesu viyolonga yayo, wamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukweli wizawikeni wanhu kwiilegeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesu kawalongela Wayahudi wowamtogole “One muhayamha mafundizo yangu, mwizakuwa wanahina wangu kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Maabaho mwizaumanya ukweli, na ukweli wizamwikani mwiilegehe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Wamwidika, “Cheye ni wazukulu wa Bulahimu. Hachinawahi kuwa watumwa kwa munhu yoyose. Vilihi kwochilongela chizailegeha?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nomulongelani kweli, munhu yoyose yoyotenda uhasanyi ni mtumwa wa uhasanyi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Mtumwa si munhu wa mwiikaye siku zose, mbali mwana ni munhu wa mwiikaye siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>One Mwana yahamtendani mwiilegehe, mwizailegeha kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Novimanya mweye mwa wazukulu wa Bulahimu. Mbali mwolonda kunikoma kwaviya hamtogola mafundizo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nowalongela chiya Tati yangu choyanilaguse, mbali mweye mwotenda chiya tati yenu chayawalongele.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Wamwidika, “Tati yetu ni Bulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu kawalongela, “One muwile wana wa Bulahimu, muhatendile fana Bulahimu viyatendile. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Niye nimulongelani kweli yoniihulike kwa Mulungu, mbali lelo mwolonda kunikoma. Bulahimu hatendile ivo bule. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Mbali mweye mwotenda vinhu ivitendigwe na tati yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Wamulongela, “Mulungu yaidumwe tati yetu chilinayo. Cheye cha wanage kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu kawalongela, “One Mulungu yawile Tati yenu, muhanilondile niye kwaviya nilawa kwa Mulungu, na sambi na hano. Sizile kwa udaho wangu mbali yeye iyo yanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Habali hamuvimanya yano yonilonga? Kwaviya mweye hamudaha kutegeleza mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Mweye mwa wana wa tati yenu Mwihi, kwa ivo mwolonda kutenda wihi fana tati yenu. Kusongela mwanduso yeye kakala mkomaji, wala hailumba na kweli, kwaviya mwabule kweli mgati mmwake. Viyovwiza koilagusa kuwa yeye ni mvwizi na ni tata wa uvwizi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Niye kwaviya nowalongelani kweli, hamunitogola. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Vino kuna munhu yoyose yoyodaha kulava ukalangama kuwa niye nina uhasanyi? One nihawalongela kweli, habali mweye hamunitogola bule? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Munhu yeli wa Mulungu kohulika chiya choyolonga Mulungu. Mweye hamumuhulika bule kwaviya siyo wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Bulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Wayahudi wamuuza Yesu, “Vino hachilongile goya kulonga weye ni msamaliya na kuna chinyamkela?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu kawedika, “Niye nabule chinyamkela. Nomtunhiza Tati yangu, mbali mweye hamunitunhiza bule. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Niye siizahilila utunhizo mwenyewo. Kauko yoyouzahila, nayo niiyo msemi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yokwamha mafundizo yangu, hezadanganika ng'o!”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Maabaho Wayahudi wamulongela Yesu, “Lelo chovimanya kuwa weye kuna chinyamkela! Bulahimu kadanganika na iviya walotezi wadanganika, mbali weye koolonga munhu yokwamha mafundizo yako hezadanganika ng'o! <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Weye vino koitenda kwa mkulu kufosa tati yetu Bulahimu? Yeye na walotezi wa Mulungu wadanganika. Vino weye koitenda kwa yelihi?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nahaitogoza mwenyewo, ukulu wangu siyo chinhu bule. Tati yangu, iyo yomulonga ni Mulungu wenu, iyo yonitunhiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Mweye hamummanyile bule, mbali niye nimmanya. One nihalonga simmanyile bule, nokuwa mvwizi fana mweye. Mbali niye nimmanya na iviya noyamha mbuli yake. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Tati yenu Bulahimu kadenelela yaniwone, nayo kaniwona, kadeng'helela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Wayahudi wamulongela Yesu, “Weye ung'hali kufikiza miyaka malongo matano, vino kumuwona Bulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela kweli, Bulahimu yang'hali hanakwelekwa, niye nabaha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Baho wadondola mabwe, walonda wamtowe Yesu. Mbali Yesu kaifisa na kalawa hanze ya Mwiikaye ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yoyelekigwe chipofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu viyakalile kofosa, kamuwona munhu imwe chipofu kusongela kwelekigwa kwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Wanahina wake wamuuza, “Mfundiza, yelihi yoyatendile uhasanyi hata munhu ino yelekigwe chipofu? Vino ni yeye mweneywo hebu tati yake na mami yake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Dino hadilawilile bule kwa sama ya uhasanyi wa munhu ino wala wa tati yake na mami yake. Munhu ino kelekigwa chipofu muladi nguvu ya Mulungu ilagusigwe muna ugima wake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Cholondeka kumsang'hanila ija yanhumile kung'hali imisi. Kwaviya chilo chokwiza, habule munhu yoyose yondayadahe kusanana. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Vinili ning'hali muna iisi, Niye niijo bung'hulo da isi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Viyamalile kuyalonga yayo, katema mate hasi, maabaho katenda nhope na kamuhaka ija ichipofu mmeso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Maabaho kamulongela, “Hita ukanawe muna dilamba da Siloamu.” Siloamu fambulo jake “Yoyatumigwe”. Baho iyo chipofu kahita, kanawa chihanga chake, maabaho kabwela ukaye kuno kowona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Wakaya wayage na wanhu wose wowamuwonile viyakalile kopula, waiuzagiza, “Vino ino siyo munhu ija yoyakalile kopula?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Wanhu wamwenga walonga, “Ino iyo yeye.” Mbali wamwenga walonga, “Si yeye bule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ivo munhu ija mwenyewo kalonga, “Niye niiyo iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Wamuuza, “Vino meso yako yagubukaze?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Kawedika, “Munhu ija yotangigwa Yesu katenda nhope, kanihaka mmeso. Maabaho kanilongela nihite Siloamu nikanawe chihanga changu. Nihita, na vininawile, bahobaho nidaha kuwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Wanahina wamuuza munhu yoyahonyigwe, “Munhu iyo kakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Kawedika, “Manye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wompeleleza chipofu yahonile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Maabaho wanhu wangala munhu ija yoyakalile chipofu kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Siku diya Yesu viyatendile nhope na kumuhonya munhu chipofu dikala Isiku ya Mhumulo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Maabaho Mafalisayo wamuuza kaidi munhu ija viya viyadahile kuwona. Nayo kawedika, “Kanihaka nhope mmeso, maabaho ninawa, na sambi nowona.” Ivo waigola wawo kwa wawo.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Walangulizi wa Mafalisayo wamwenga walonga, “Munhu iyo yoyatendile ivo halawile kwa Mulungu, kwaviya hamha bule Malagilizo ya Isiku ya Mhumulo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Mbali wamwenga walonga, “Munhu mwene uhasanyi kodahaze kutenda vilaguso vino va mauzauza?”<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Maabaho wamuuza kaidi munhu ija, “Kulonga munhu iyo kakuhonya meso yako. Lelo weye kwolongaze kumsonhela munhu iyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Kawedika, “Munhu iyo ni mulotezi wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Wayahudi wakala hawanatogola bule kuwa munhu ija kakala chipofu, maabaho kadaha kuwona. Ivo wawatanga tati yake na mami yake, <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>wawauza, “Vino ino mwanenu? Mulonga kelekigwa chipofu, lelo kadahaze kuwona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Tati yake na mami yake wawedika, “Cheye chivimanya ino niiyo mwanetu, na iviya kelekwa chipofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Mbali viya viyadahile kuwona, hebu yelihi yoyangubule yameso hachivimanyile bule. Muuzeni mwenyewo. Yeye mkulu ngima, ivo kodaha kwidika mwenyewo!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Tati yake na mami yake walonga ivo kwaviya wakala wowadumba walangulizi wa Wayahudi. Walangulizi wawo walonga munhu yoyose yondayalonge kuwa Yesu niiyo Chilisito kezawingigwa mwiikaye ya Kutosela. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Lekamana tati yake na mami yake walonga, “Muuzeni mwenyewo. Yeye ni munhu mkulu ngima!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Wayahudi wamtanga kaidi munhu ija yoyakalile chipofu, wamulongela, “Wilahe kwa Mulungu one kwolonga ukweli. Cheye chovimanya munhu iyo yoyakuhonyile kana uhasanyi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Munhu ija kawedika, “One kana uhasanyi, niye sivimanya bule. Chinhu chimwe muhala chonimanyile, nikala nitulika yameso, sambi nowona!”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Maabaho wamuuza kaidi, “Vino katenda choni? Katendaze kukuhonya yameso yako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Nayo kawedika, “Niwalongela, mbali hamulondile kutegeleza. Lelo mwolonda kuhulika mbuli ino kaidi? Hebu na mweye mwolonda muwe wanahina wake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Maabaho wamuliga na wamulongela, “Weye kwa mwanahina wake! Cheye cha wanahina wa Musa! <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Chivimanya Mulungu kalonga na Musa, mbali munhu ija hachimmanyile bule koyolawa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Munhu ija yoyakalile chipofu kawalongela, “Mwonyazanya! Mweye hamuvimanyile koyolawa, mbali kanihonya meso yangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Chovimanya Mulungu hawategeleza bule wanhu weli na uhasanyi, mbali komtegeleza munhu yoyose yomuhuwila na yoyotenda chiya chiyomulondile yatende. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Kwandusila isi viilumbigwe, habule munhu yoyahulike kuwa munhu yoyose kamuhonya munhu yoyelekigwe chipofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>One munhu ino halawile kwa Mulungu bule, sigambe yadahe kutenda chinhu chochose.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Wamulongela, “Lola weye kwelekwa muna uhasanyi. Lelo weye kwodahaze kuchifundiza cheye?” Baho wamuwinga mwi ikaye ya Kutosela.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Upofu wa chimuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu kahulika kuwa munhu ija yoyamuhonyile kawingigwa mwiikaye ya Kutosela. Ivo viyamuwonile kamuuza, “Vino weye komuhuwila Mwana wa Munhu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Munhu ija kamulongela, “Mwenevale, vino munhu iyo yelihi? Nilongele muladi na niye nimuhuwile!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kumuwona kumala, munhu iyo youlonga nayo sambi ni iyo!”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Maabaho munhu ija kamulongela, “Mndewa, nohuwila.” Maabaho kumtumbalila mavindi Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Niza mwiisi ino kutagusa, vipofu wawone, na wanhu wowona wawe vipofu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Mafalisayo wamwenga wowakalile hamwe na wawo wahulika mbuli izo, wamuuza, “Vino na cheye iviya cha vipofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu kawedika, “One muwile vipofu, sigambemuwe na uhasanyi. Mbali sambi mwolonga mwowona, ivo mung'hali na uhasanyi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Simwe da mdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose one hengile bule muna ichikwama cha ng'hondolo kufosela muulwivi, mbali kaibebenyeka na kwingila kwa nzila zimwenga, iyo mbavi na muhokaji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Munhu yokwingila kwa kufosela muulwivi iyo niiyo ndimi wa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Mkalizi wa lwivi komfungulila munhu iyo, ng'hondolo wohulika dizi jake. Nayo kowatanga ng'hondolo wake kwa mazina yawo, maabaho kowagala kunze. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Yahawalava kunze ng'hondolo wake, kowalongolela, nawo wamuinza kwaviya wadimanya dizi jake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Hawamuinza munhu imwenga bule, mbali wezamulema kwaviya hawadimanyile dizi da munhu imwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu kawalongela simwe dino, mbali wawo hawavimanyile chiya chayalongile.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mdimi yanogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Maabaho Yesu kawalongela kaidi, “Nowalongela kweli, niye ni ulwivi wa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Wanhu wose wowanilongolele niye wawo wabavi na iviya wahokaji, na ng'hondolo hawawahulike bule. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Niye ni lwivi. Munhu yoyose yoyokwingila kufosela niye kezakomboligwa. Kezakwingila na kulawa kuzahila ndiya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Mbavi kokwiza kwa lungilo da kubawa, kukoma na kubananga. Niye niza kwa lungilo da kuwatenda muwe na ugima, na iviya sekemuhungukiligwe na chinhu chochose muna ugima wenu.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Niye ni ndimi ninogile. Ndimi yanogile kolava ugima wake kwa ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Munhu yoyolihigwa kwa kuwadima ng'hondolo, na si mwene ng'hondolo, yahamuwona mbwizi kokwiza, kowaleka ng'hondolo na kokimbila. Ivo mbwizi kowagwila na kuwapwililisa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Kokimbila kwaviya ni munhu wa kulihigwa muhala, na hawagesa ng'hondolo bule. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Niye ni ndimi ninogile. Nowamanya ng'hondolo wangu, na ng'hondolo wangu wonimanya niye. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Fana Tata viyonimanya na niye nommanya Tata, na noulava ugima wangu kwa ichimu cha ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Iviya ninawo ng'hondolo wamwenga, wawo siyo wa chikwama chino. Wawo nawo nolondeka niwagale hano iviya. Wezadihulika dizi jangu, na kwizakuwa bumbila dimwe da ng'hondolo na mdimi imwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Tati yangu konilonda kwaviya noulava ugima wangu muladi niuhokele kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Habule munhu yonihoka ugima wangu. Noulava kwa kulonda mwenyewo. Nina udaho wa kuulava, na nina udaho wa kuusola kaidi ugima wangu. Vino ivo Tata viyanilagilize nitende.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Mbuli zino za Yesu ziwatenda Wayahudi waibagule kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Wanhu wengi walonga, “Ino kana chinyamkela na iviya kana chipeyu. Vino habali mwomtegeleza?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Mbali wamwenga walonga, “Munhu mwene chinyamkela kodahaze kulonga vino? Vino chinyamkela kodaha kumuhonya munhu chipofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi womulema Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Uko Yelusalemu kukala na Dugila da kuika wakifu Kaye ya Mulungu, iviya ukala msimu wa chihuhwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu kakala muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, kogenda muna uluhelengo lwa Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Wayahudi wamzunguluka, wamuuza, “Vino kwizachileka muna umkangagile mbaka lini? Chilongele funhu funhu fana weye kwa Chilisito.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nimulongelani, mbali hamuhuwile bule. Mauzauza yonitenda kwa zina da Tati yangu yoniyalagusa, <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>mbali mweye hamtogola kwaviya mweye siyo ng'hondolo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ng'hondolo wangu wodihulika dizi jangu, nowamanya nawo woniwinza. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Nowena ugima wa siku zose, nawo hawezadanganika bule. Habule munhu yoyodaha kuwalava mmakono yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Tati yangu yoyaninile wawo, ka mkulu kufosa wose. Habule munhu yoyodaha kuwalava mmakono ya Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Niye na Tata cha wamwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Wayahudi wadondola mabwe kaidi muladi wamtowe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nimulagusani mauzauza mengi kulawa kwa Tata. Vino uzauza dilihi dodimtendani munitowe na mabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Wayahudi wamwidika, “Hachikutowa na mabwe kwaviya kutenda mauzauza, mbali chikutowa kwaviya kumuliga Mulungu! Weye kwa munhu, mbali kwolonga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino hayandikigwe bule muna Yamalagilizo yenu Mulungu kalonga, ‘Mweye mwa milungu’? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Mulungu kawatanga ‘milungu’ waja wenigwe usenga wake, na cheye chivimanya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga kweli siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Tata kanisagula na kunituma niye muna iisi. Lelo mwolonga nimuliga Mulungu kwaviya nilonga ‘Niye na Mwana wa Mulungu’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>One sitenda bule sang'hano za Tati yangu zoyolonda nitende sekemunihuwile. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Mbali one notenda sang'hano zake, hata fana hamunihuwila, basi togoleni sang'hano izo, muladi mumanye na kutambula kuwa Tata kamgati mmwangu na niye namgati mmwake.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Maabaho walonda wangwile kaidi, mbali Yesu kawabanga.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Maabaho Yesu kabwela kaidi mwambu wa dilamba da Yolodani, hanhu Yohana hayakalile kobatiza, na kakala uko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Wanhu wengi wamuhitila, walonga, “Yohana hatendile mauzauza bule, mbali chila mbuli iyamulongele munhu ino ikala kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Wanhu wengi hanhu haja wamuhuwila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Munhu imwe yoyatangigwe Lazalo kakala mtamu. Munhu ino kakala mkaya wa Besaniya, chibululu chiwakalile wokala Maliya na Masa ndugu yake. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Maliya ino iyo ija yoyabobode magulu ya Mndewa mavuta ya kunung'hila goya na kuyahangusa kwa mvili zake. Lelo Lazalo lumbu jake iyo yakalile mtamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Ivo ndugu zake Lazalo wamtumila Yesu usenga, “Mndewa, mbwiyako youmulonda kolumwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesu viyahulike vino, kalonga, “Utamu uno hauzamkoma Lazalo bule mbali unpata kwa ichimu cha ukulu wa Mulungu muladi Mwana wa Munhu yatunhizigwe kufosela utamu uno.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesu kakala kowalonda Masa na mwali wake na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Yesu viyahulike kuwa Lazalo mtamu, kongeza kukala siku mbili haja hayakalile. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Maabaho kawalongela wanahina wake, “Chibwele Yudeya”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Wanahina wake wamulongela, “Mfundiza! Siku ndodo zifosile Wayahudi walonda kukukoma na mabwe, habali kolonda uhite kaidi hanhu haja?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu kawedika, “Imisi ina masaa longo na maidi. Munhu yahagenda imisi hadaha kuikwala, kwaviya kodiwona bung'hulo da isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Mbali munhu yahagenda ichilo kezaikwala, kwaviya kabule bung'hulo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Maabaho Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Mbwiyetu Lazalo kagona, mbali niye nohita kumulamsa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Wanahina wake wamwidika, “Mndewa, one kagona, kezahona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesu kakala kolonga Lazalo kadanganika, mbali wanahina wake wagesa Lazalo kagona. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Maabaho Yesu kawalongela funhu funhu, “Lazalo kadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Nodenelela kwa ichimu chenu kwaviya sikalile nayo bule, muladi munitogole. Goza chihite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Maabaho Tomasi, yatangigwe Mbasa, kawalongela wanahina wayage, “Goza chihite na mfundiza muladi chidanganike hamwe nayo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni uzilibuko na ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesu viyafikile uko, kalufika lukuli lwa Lazalo luwandigwa mdileme lumala siku nne zifosile. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Chibululu cha Besaniya chikala habehi na Yelusalemu, utali wa ugenzi wa maili mbili, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>ivo Wayahudi wengi weza kwa Masa na Maliya kuwafaliji kwa ifa ya ndugu yawo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Masa viyahulike Yesu kokwiza, kahita kumuhokela, mbali Maliya kasigala ukaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Masa kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, one uwile hano, lumbu jangu sigambeyadanganike bule! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Mbali novimanya hata sambi Mulungu kezakwina chochose chondaunpule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lumbu jako kezazilibuka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Masa kamwidika, “Novimanya kezazilibuka muna isiku ya uhelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Niye ni uzilibuko na ugima. Munhu yoyose yoyonihuwila niye, hata yahadanganika kezakuwa ngima. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Na munhu yoyose yeli mgima na yonihuwila niye hezadanganika ng'o!. Vino koyahuwila yayo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Masa kamwidika, “Wona, Mndewa! Nohuwila weye kwa Chilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu, yezile mwii isi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulilila Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Masa viyalongile vino, kahita ukaye na kumtanga Maliya mwali wake chinyelenyele. Kamulongela, “Mfundiza kabaha, kokutanga.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Maliya viyahulike vino, kenuka himahima kamuhitila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Yesu kakala yang'hali kwingila muna dibululu, mbali kakala kema hanhu haja haja Masa hayamuhokele. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Wayahudi wowakalile ukaye wamfaliji Maliya, viwamuwonile Maliya kenuka na kulawa kunze himahima, wagesa kohita kulila kudileme.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Maliya viyafikile hanhu hayakalile Yesu, kamuwona, kumtumbalila mavindi, na kamulongela, “Mndewa, one uwile baha, lumbu jangu sigambeyadanganike bule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu viyamuwonile Maliya kolila na Wayahudi wowezile nayo nawo wolila, kapata luholozi muumoyo wake na kawona usungu. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Maabaho Yesu kawauza, “Mumuwanda kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wamwidika, “Mndewa, izo ulole”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu kalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Maabaho Wayahudi walonga, “Loleni viyamulondile!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Mbali wamwenga walonga, “One kamuhonya munhu chipofu, vino kapotigwa kumtenda Lazalo sekeyadanganike?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesu viyakalile kaidi na luholozi na kugazigwa muna umoyo wake, kahita mbaka kudileme. Leme ijo dikala tuka digubikigwe na dibwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Dibimbiliseni idibwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Masa, lumbu wa ija yadanganike kamulongela, “Mndewa, mbali kezanung'ha. Kakala siku nne kusongela viyadanganike.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Maabaho Yesu kamulongela, “Vino sikulongele one wahahuwila kwizawona utunhizo wa Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ivo wadibimbilisa idibwe. Maabaho Yesu kalola kuulanga, kalonga, “Tata, nokwina hewela kwaviya weye konhegeleza. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Novimanya kunitegeleza siku zose, mbali nolonga vino muladi wanhu wowemile hano, watogole kuwa weye kunhuma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesu viyalongile ivo, katanga kwa dizi kulu, “Lazalo, lawa kunze!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Lazalo kalawa kunze, makono yake na magulu yake yazingilizigwa sanda, na chihanga chake chigubikigwa na walo. Yesu kawalongela, “Mfunguleni na mumuleke yahite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wotenda mpango wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Masayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliki 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Wayahudi wengi wowezile kumulaula Maliya wawona yoyatendile Yesu, ivo wamuhuwila. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Mbali Wayahudi wamwenga wahita kwa Mafalisayo, wawalongela yaja yoyatendile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Ivo Mafalisayo na wakulu wa nhambiko waiting'hana na wanhu wa chitala cha Wayahudi, waiuzagiza, “Chitende choni? Munhu ino kotenda mauzauza mengi?”<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mkulu wa nhambiko wa Chiyahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>One chihamuleka yagendelele, wanhu wose wezamuhuwila, maabaho Waloma wezakwiza kubananga Kaye yetu ya Mulungu na isi yetu.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Maabaho imwe wawo, yoyatangigwe Kayafa, yoyakalile Mkulu wa Nhambiko Digogogo umwaka uja, kalonga, “Mweye mwawabozi! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Vino hammanyile bule kuwa muhavu munhu imwe kumwenu yadanganike muladi wanhu wa isi yose wakomboligwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Hamanyile chiyakalile kolonga, mbali kwaviya kakala mkulu wa nhambiko wa umwaka uja, kalagula kuwa Yesu kezadanganika kwa ichimu cha Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Wala siyo kwa ichimu cha Wayahudi muhala, mbali kezadanganika muladi yaweke hamwe wana wa Mulungu wowapwililike.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ivo kwandusila siku diya, walangulizi wa Wayahudi wazahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Ivo Yesu hahitile kaidi kuno kowoneka mwa Wayahudi, mbali kalawa uko na kuhita habehi na bwilingu, kuna ichibululu chitangigwe Efulaimu. Uko kakala na wanahina wake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Siku da Dugila da Wayahudi da Pasaka vidikalile habehi kufika, wanhu wengi wahita Yelusalemu muladi wakasafyigwe ing'hali Pasaka kufika. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Wakala womzahila Yesu, ivo viwaiting'hane muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, waiuzagiza, “Mwowonaze? Vino hezakwiza bule muna Didugila?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo walagiliza one munhu yoyose kovimanya kuyeli Yesu, kolondeka yalonge muladi wangwile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwitililigwa mavuta uko Besaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Masayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliki 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Zing'hali siku sita kufika dugila da Pasaka, Yesu kafika Besaniya, ukaye kwa Lazalo, ija yoyamzilibule. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Wanhu wamsasalila Yesu ndiya ya ichigulogulo, Masa kakala kowasananila. Lazalo kakala imwe wa wanhu wowakalile haimeza na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Maabaho Maliya kasola chichupa cha mavuta yonung'hila goya yoyaguligwe kwa hela ng'hulu, kamboboda Yesu mmagulu na kumuhangusa kwa nyele zake. Kaye yose inung'ha goya. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yuda Isikaliyoti, imwe wa wanahina wake, ija yondayambiduke Yesu kauza, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Lelo habali mavuta yano sekeyachuuzigwe kwa dinali magana matatu, na hela zondazipatike wenigwe ngayengaye?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Halongile vino kwaviya kawawonela ubazi ngayengaye, mbali kwaviya kakala npapaji wa mkoba wa hela, na lusita lumwenga kakala yobawaga hela.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesu kawedika, “Sekemungaze! Mulekeni yayeke kwa ichimu cha siku da kuwandigwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Siku zose munawo ngayengaye, mbali hamwizakala na niye siku zose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpango wa kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Wayahudi wengi viwahulike Yesu kakala Besaniya, wahita. Hawahitile kumuwona Yesu yaidumwe, mbali iviya wahita kumuwona Lazalo, munhu yoyazilibuke. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Ivo walangulizi wa wakulu wa nhambiko wazahila nzila ya kumkoma Lazalo iviya, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>kwaviya Wayahudi wengi wamuhitila Yesu na kumuhuwila kwa ichimu cha chiya chimulawilile Lazalo.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa deng'ho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Masayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliki 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Siku isondelele wanhu wengi wowezile kuna Didugila da Pasaka, wahulika Yesu kakala kokwiza Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Ivo wasola matambi ya mitende, wahita kunze kumuhokela, walandula, “Nhogolwa Mulungu Mulopozi! Mulungu kamtemela mate yoyokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa! Mulungu kamtemela mate Mfalume wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu kamuwona mwana chihongwe, kakala mchanyha yake, fana viyandikigwe muna Yamaandiko Yelile,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Sekendumbe, wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Mfalume wenu kokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">kakala uchanyha ya mwana chihongwe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Mwanduso wanahina wake hawamanyile bule mbuli zino. Mbali Yesu viyatunhizigwe, wanahina wakumbuka chila chinhu. Vose vilawilila fana Maandiko Yelile viyalongile.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Wanhu wowakalile na Yesu haja viyamtangile Lazalo kulawa muna dileme na kunzilibula, wagendelela kulonga yaja yoyalawilile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ivo wanhu wengi wahita kumuhokela Yesu kwaviya wahulika Yesu katenda chilaguso chino cha mauzauza. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Ivo Mafalisayo wailongela, “Loleni, hachidaha kutenda chochose. Wanhu wose womuwinza!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wagiliki wolonda kumuwona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Kukala na Wagiliki wengi muna iwanhu wezile Yelusalemu kutosa muna Didugila da Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Wamuhitila Filipo, mkaya wa Besisaida yili muna iisi ya Galilaya, wamulongela, “Mwenevale, chiye cholonda kumuwona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo kahita na kamulongela Andeleya, na wose waidi wahita kumulongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu kawedika, “Chipindi cha kutunhizigwa Mwana wa Munhu sambi chifika. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Nowalongela kweli, mhule ya uhemba one hailagale muulongo na kudanganika, izasigala imwe muhala. Mbali one ihadanganika, izakweleka mbeyu nyingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Munhu yoyose yoyolonda ugima wake kezawagiza, mbali munhu yoyose yoyowihila ugima wake mwi isi ino, kezakwing'higwa ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Munhu yoyose yoyolonda kunisang'hanila kolondeka yaniwinze. Hohose honili, mtumigwa wangu kolondeka yawe baho iviya. One munhu yahanisang'hanila, Tati yangu kezamwing'ha nhogolwa munhu iyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Sambi moyo wangu una luholozi. Nilonge choni? Vino nilonge ‘Tata, one yahadahika, unyepule na nhungo ino ya manhesa ichipindi chino?’ Bule, niza muna iisi muladi nifosele chipindi chino cha manhesa. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Tata, ditunhize zina jako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Maabaho dizi kulawa kuulanga dilonga, “Niditunhiza, na nizaditunhiza kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Wanhu wengi wemile haja wadihulika dizi diya, wamwenga walonga dikala bumo, mbali wamwenga walonga, “Msenga wa kuulanga kalonga nayo!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Dizi ijo hadilawile kwa ichimu changu, mbali kwa ichimu chenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Suku da kutagusigwa isi ino difika, mkulu wa isi ino kezahinduligwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Vondaninuligwe mchanyha ya isi, nizawatenda wanhu wose weze kumwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Yesu kalonga vino kulagusa ni ifa ilihi yoondayadanganike.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Lung'husesa lwa wanhu lumuuza, “Malagilizo yetu yolonga kuwa Chilisito kezakuwa ngima siku zose. Habali lelo kwolonga ‘Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yenuligwe?’ Vino ino Mwana wa Munhu iyo yelihi?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwizakala mudibung'hulo kwa lusita ludodo. Gendeni na dibung'hulo, ding'hali ziza hadinamfikani na kuwahuma. Kwaviya munhu yogenda ndiziza hamanya koyohita. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Ditogoleni bung'hulo kwaviya munajo, muladi muwe wana wa bung'hulo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Wayahudi wolema kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu viyalongile ivo, kasegela na kwiifisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Vilemela Yesu katenda mauzauza yano yose haulongozi wawo, mbali wawo hawamtogole bule. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Yano yose yalawilila muladi yatimie yaja yalongigwe na mulotezi wa Mulungu Isaya viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mndewa, munhu ilihi yoyotogola usenga wetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Munhu yelihi Mndewa yoyangubulile nguvu zake?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Ivo hawadahile bule kuhuwila, kwaviya Isaya iviya kalonga,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Mulungu kayapofula meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kaitenda midala mizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">muladi sekewawone kwa meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na sekewavimanye kwa nzewele zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na sekewanihindukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">muladi niwahonye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaya kalonga mbuli izo kwaviya kauwona utunhizo wa Yesu na kalonga mbuli zake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Hata walangulizi wengi wa Wayahudi wamuhuwila Yesu. Mbali Mafalisayo hawamtogole muumwingi, kwaviya wadumba kuwingigwa mwiikaye ya kutosela, <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>na kwaviya walonda kutunhizigwa na wanhu kufosa kutunhizigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keza mwiisi kuwakombola wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Maabaho Yesu kalandula dizi, “Munhu yoyonihuwila niye, hanihuwila niye muhala, mbali iviya komuhuwila ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Munhu yoyose yoniwona niye, iviya komuwona ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Niye na bung'hulo dodizile mwiisi, muladi wanhu wose wowonihuwila sekewakale muna diziza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>One munhu kozihulika mbuli zangu na hazamha bule, niye simtagusa. Kwaviya sizile kutagusa wanhu wa isi mbali kuwakombola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Munhu yoyose yondema niye na kulema mafundizo yangu kauko yondayamtaguse. Mbuli iyo yonilongile iyo yondaimtaguse muna isiku ya uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Kwaviya silonga kwa udaho wangu bule, mbali Tata yanhumile kanilagiliza chonilondeka kulonga.” <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Niye novimanya kuwa lagilizo jake dogala ugima wa siku zose. Ivo nolonga yaja Tata yoyanilongele niyalonge.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowanava magulu wanahina wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Ding'hali hadinafika Didugila da Pasaka, Yesu kakala kovimanya saa yake ifika yondayasegele hano muiisi kuhita kwa Tati yake. Kakala kawalonda nani wanhu wake weli hano mwiisi, nayo kawalonda mbaka kuuhelelo.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesu na wanahina wake wakala woja ndiya ya ichilo. Mwihi kakala kamwingila kamala Yuda Isikaliyoti, mwana wa Saimoni, muladi yambiduke Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu kakala yavimanyile Tata kamwing'ha udaho wa chila chinhu, na iviya kakala yalawile kwa Mulungu na kezabwela kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Ivo kahasegela hana indiya, keka ngolole wake hamgwazo, maabaho kasola ngolole, kaifunga mchigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Maabaho kaguma yamazi muna ichiziga, kandusa kuwanava migulu iwanahina wake na kuhangusa na chiya ichikumbi choyaifungile mchigudi.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Yesu kafika kwa Saimoni Petili. Saimoni kamuuza, “Mndewa, vino weye kwizaninava magulu yangu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Chonitenda sambi weye huchimanya bule, mbali kwizachimanya hamwande.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petili kamulongela Yesu, “Bule! Weye hwizaninava magulu ng'o.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu kamwidika, “One sikunavile magulu yako, hwizakuwa mwanahina wangu kaidi!”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Saimoni Petili kamulongela, “Mndewa, sekeunave magulu muhala, mbali iviya unave makono yangu na ditwi jangu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu kedika, “Munhu yoyogile kela lukuli lwose na kolondigwa yanave magulu muhala. Mweye mwela, ingawa simose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesu kamala kummanya ija yondayambiduke lekamana kalonga si wose welile.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu viyamalile kuwanava magulu yawo, kayawala ngolole wake, kabwela ha indiya, kakala hasi. Kawauza, “Vino muyamanya yoniwatendele? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Mwonitanga mfundiza na Mndewa, mwotenda goya kwaviya ivo vinili. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Niye, Mndewa na mfundiza wenu niwanavani mweye magulu yenu, mweye iviya mwolondeka mwinave magulu yenu mweye kwa mweye. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Nimulagusani simwe, na mweye mwolondeka kutenda fana viniwatendele. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Nowalongela kweli, habule mtumwa mkulu kufosa mwenevale wake, wala habule mtumigwa mkulu kufosa ija yamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Sambi mwovimanya vinhu vino, one muhavitenda, Mulungu kezamtemelani mate.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Silonga mbuli zino kumwenu mose, nowamanya waja woniwasagule. Mbali Yamaandiko Yelile yolondeka yatimie, yaja yoyolonga, ‘Munhu ija yoja hamwe na niye, kezanibiduka.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Nowalongela yano ivino sambi yang'hali hayana lawilila, muladi vondayalawilile, mdahe kutogola kuwa niye ‘Niye Iyo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Nowalongelani kweli! Munhu yoyose yondayamuhokele munhu yoyanitumile, konihokela niye. Na munhu yoyose yondayanihokele niye, komuhokela ija yoyanhumile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula munhu yonda yambiduke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Masayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliki 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Nayo Yesu viyamalile kulonga yayo, kengilwa na luholozi muumoyo, kalonga, “Nowalongela kweli, imwe wenu kezanibiduka”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Wanahina wailola, hawavimanyile bule komulonga yelihi. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Mwanahina imwe yoyalondigwe ng'hani na Yesu kakala yakalile habehi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Saimoni Petili kamfunyiza, kamulongela, “Muuze komulonga yelihi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Ivo mwanahina iyo kumkwenhukila Yesu habehi, kamuuza, “Mndewa, vino komulonga yelihi?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu ija yondanimwine gate doniditoweze mwiibakuli ni iyo.” Maabaho katoweza gate, kamwing'ha Yuda, mwana wa Saimoni Isikaliyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Bahobaho Yuda viyasolile gate, Lufyende kamwingila. Yesu kamulongela, “Tenda himahima chiulonda kutenda!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Mbali habule munhu mwa iwaja wowakalile wokala hana indiya yavimanyile habali Yesu kamulongela ivo Yuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Kwaviya Yuda kakala kopapa mkoba wa hela, wanahina wamwenga wagesa Yesu kakala komulongela yahite yakagule ndiya ya dugila, hebu yakawene chinhu ngayengaye.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yuda viyahokele gate, kalawa kunze lusita ulwo ulwo. Ikala ichilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ya sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuda viyasegele Yesu kalonga, “Sambi Mwana wa Munhu kezatunhizigwa, na Mulungu kezatunhizigwa kufosela Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Na one ukulu wa Mulungu ugubuligwa kufosela Mwana, maabaho Mulungu mwenyewo kezaugubula ukulu wa Mwana wa Munhu mgati mmwake mwenyewo, na bahobaho kezamtunhiza. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Wanangu, nizakala na mweye lusita ludodo. Mwizanizahila, mbali sambi nowalongela chiya choniwalongele Wayahudi, ‘Hamdaha kuhita hanhu honihita niye.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Lelo nowena lagilizo da sambi, mwilonde mweye kwa mweye. Fana niye vinimulondeleni mweye, na mweye mwilonde ivo ivo. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>One muhailonda mweye kwa mweye, wanhu wose wezavimanya mweye mwa wanahina wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula Petili kezambela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Masayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliki 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Saimoni Petili kamuuza, “Mndewa, vino kohita kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu kamwidika, “Hudaha bule kuniwinza hanhu honihita sambi, mbali hamwande kuzaniwinza.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petili kamulongela, “Mndewa, habali sidaha kukuwinza sambi? Nizadanganika kwa ichimu chako!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Ivo vino weye kwodaha kudanganika kwa ichimu changu? Nokulongela kweli, yang'hali nzogolo hanakwika, kwizanibela miyanza mitatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni nzila ya kuhita kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>“Sekemwingilwe na luholozi muna imizoyo yenu. Momuhuwila Mulungu, nihuwileni na niye. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Muna ikaye ya Tati yangu muna viheleto vingi, one siivo, nahawalongeleni. Nohita kuwasasalila hanhu henu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Nahahita na kuwasasalila hanhu, nizakwiza kuwasola muladi mukale haja honikala niye. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Moimanya nzila ya hanhu haja honihita.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi kamulongela, “Mndewa, hachivimanyile bule kohita kulihi, lelo choimanyaze nzila?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Niye niiyo nzila, na ukweli, na ugima. Habule munhu yodaha kuhita kwa Tata bila kufosela kumwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>“One munimanya niye, na Tati yangu iviya muhammanyile, kusongela sambi mummanya na mumuwona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo kamulongela, “Mndewa, uchilagusile Tata, iyo niiyo ichinzahila.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nikala na mweye siku nyingi, Filipo hunanimanya bule? Munhu yoyose yoyaniwone niye kamuwona Tata. Habali kolonga ‘Chilaguse Tata’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Weye huhuwila bule kuwa niye na mgati mwa Tata, na Tata kamgati yangu? Mbuli ziniwalongelani siyo zangu bule, mbali Tata yokala mgati yangu niiyo yozisang'hana sang'hano zake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Muhuwile haja haniwalongele, Niye namgati mwa Tata na Tata kamgati yangu. One hamuhuwile ivo, muhuwile kwa zisaano zinitendile. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yondayanihuwile niye kezatenda viya vinitendile. Kezatenda vinhu vikulu kufosa vino, kwaviya Niye nohita kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Na nizamtendelani chochose chondamupule kwa zina jangu, muladi Tata yatunhizigwe mgati mwa Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>One muhapula chinhu chochose kwa zina jangu nizamtendelani.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kezachigalila Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“One muhanilonda, mwizakwamha Malagilizo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Nizampula Tata, nayo kezamwing'hani Mtazi imwenga, nayo kezakala na mweye siku zose. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Iyo Muhe Yelile iyogubula kweli. Wanhu wa isi ino hawadaha bule kumuhokela kwaviya hawadaha kumuwona na kummanya. Mbali mweye mwommanya, kwaviya kokala na mweye na kezakuwa mgati mmwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Vondanisegele, sizamulekani wachiwa, nizambwelelani. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Muna ichipindi chidodo chikwiza wanhu wa isi ino hawezaniwona kaidi bule, mbali mweye mwizaniwona, kwaviya namgima, na mweye iviya mwizakala wagima. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Muna isiku iyo mwizavimanya kuwa Niye namgati mwa Tati yangu, na mweye mwamgati mmwangu, na Niye namgati mmwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Wanhu waja wohokela Malagilizo yangu na kuyamha, wanhu wawo wonilonda. Tati yangu kezawalonda wanhu waja wowonilonda niye, iviya na niye nizawalonda na kuilagusa kumwawo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yuda, mbali siyo Isikaliyoti, kalonga, “Mndewa, habali kolonda kuilagusa kumwetu muhala na siyo kwa wanhu weli muna iisi yose bule?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu yoyose yonilonda niye kezayamha Malagilizo yangu, na Tati yangu kezamulonda‚ niye na Tati yangu chizakwiza kumwake na kukala nayo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Munhu yoyose hanilonda niye hayamha bule Malagilizo yangu. Na mafundizo yomuhulike siyo yangu bule, yolawa kwa Tata yanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Nimulongelani vinhu vino vinikalile ning'hali hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Tati yangu kezangalilani Mtazi, iyo Muhe Yelile, Tata yondayamtume kwa zina jangu, kezawafundiza yose na kuwakumbusa yose yoniwalongele.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Nowalekelani tindiwalo, nomwinani tindiwalo jangu. Simwinani bule fana isi voitenda. Sekemwazanywe. Sekemudumbe. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Muhulika viniwalongeleni, ‘Nosegela na nizambwelelani.’ One munilonda niye, mwizadenelela kwaviya nohita kwa Tata kwaviya yeye ni mkulu kufosa niye. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Nimulongeleni yang'hali hayanalawilila, muladi vondayalawilile muhuwile. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Sizalonga na mweye kaidi mbuli nyingi, kwaviya mkulu wa isi ino kokwiza. Iyo kabule nguvu kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Mbali chila munhu muna iisi kolondeka kuvimanya kuwa nomulonda Tata na nosanana chiya choyanilagilize niye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Lelo izoni chihite.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mzabibu wa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>“Niye nanzabibu wa kweli, na Tati yangu iyo mulimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Chila tambi mgati mmwangu dohadikwima matunda, yeye kodikanha. Mbali kodahulila chila tambi dodikwima matunda muladi dime matunda mengi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Mweye mwela mumala kwa ichimu cha mbuli ija inimulongeleni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Kaleni mgati yangu, na niye nizakala mgati yenu. Tambi hadidaha kwima matunda diidumwe, ila one dihakala muna umbiki dodaha. Iviya na mweye hamdaha kwima matunda mbaka mkale mgati mmwangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Niye nanzabibu, mweye mwa matambi. Munhu yahakala mgati mmwangu na niye mgati mmwake, kezakweleka matunda mengi, kwaviya mwiidumwe hamdaha bule kutenda chochose. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>One munhu yoyose hakala mgati mmwangu, kokwasigwa kunze fana viya matambi viyakwasigwa na kunyala. Wanhu woyadondola matambi yayo na woyeka muumoto yalungule. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>One mwahakala mgati mmwangu na mbuli zangu zizakala mgati mmwenu, puleni chochose chimulonda mwizakwing'higwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Mwahakweleka matunda mengi na kuilagusa kuwa mwawanahina wangu, Tati yangu kotunhizigwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Fana viya Tata viyanilondile niye, iviya niye nomulondani mweye. Lelo kaleni muna dilondo jangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>One muhamha Malagilizo yangu, mwizakala muna dilondo jangu, fana niye viniyamhile Malagilizo ya Tata na kukala muna dilondo jake.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Nimulongelani yano yose muladi ndeng'helelo yangu ikale mgati mmwenu na ndeng'heleo yenu sekeimale. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ndagilizi yangu iyo ino, Mwiilonde mweye kwa mweye, fana niye vinimulondileni mweye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Habule ulondo mkulu kufosa ulondo wa munhu kulava ugima wake kwa ichimu cha mbwiya zake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Mweye mwa wambwiya zangu one muhatenda yaja yoniwalagilize. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Sizamtangani mweye watumwa kaidi, kwaviya mtumwa hazimanya sang'hano za mwenevale wake. Mbali nowatanga mweye mbwiya zangu kwaviya nimulongelani vinhu vose vinilongiligwe na Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Mweye hamunisagule niye, mbali niye nimsagulani mweye muhite mukeleke matunda, matunda yoyokala. Tata nayo kezamwig'hani chochose chondamupule kwa zina jangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Lagilizo jangu ijo dino, mwiilonde mweye kwa mweye.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yowehila wanahina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“One wanhu wa isi yose wahamwihilani mweye, muvimanye kuwa mosi wanihila niye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>One muwile wanhu wa isi ino, wanhu wake wahamulondeni. Mbali mweye siyo wanhu wa isi ino. Niye nimsagulani kulawa muna iisi ino, kwa ichimu icho wanhu wa isi ino womwihilani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Mukumbuke chiniwalongele, ‘Mtumwa siyo mkulu kufosa mwenevale wake.’ One wanhu wonigaza niye, iviya na mweye wezangazani. One woyamha Malagilizo yangu iviya wezayamha malagilizo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Wezamtendelani yano yose kwa zina jangu, kwaviya hawammanyile bule ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>One sizile na kulonga nawo, wahadahile kulonga wabule uhasanyi. Mbali sambi hawadaha kulonga wabule uhasanyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Munhu yoyose yonihila niye komwihila Tati yangu iviya. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>One sitendile bule kumwawo sang'hano ziya habule munhu yoyose imwenga yoyazitendile, sigambe wawe na uhasanyi. Mbali lelo wayawona yanitendile, na wang'hali wonihila niye na iviya womwihila Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Mbali yano yolawilila muladi Yamaandiko Yelile yandikigwe muna Yamalagilizo yawo yawe kweli, ‘Wanhu wanihila bule.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Baho mtazi vondayeze kulawa kwa tata niiyo muhe wa kweli, iyo kezalonga mbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Mweye iviya mwolondeka kulonga mbuli zangu, kwaviya mukala na niye kusongela mwanduso.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Yesu kagendelela kulonga yano yose, muladi sekemuuleke uhuwilo wenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Wanhu wezawingigwa munazikaye za kutosela, na chipindi chokwiza wezawakoma na kugesa womsang'hanila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Wezawatendela vinhu vino kwaviya hawammanyile Tata wala hawanimanyile niye. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Niwalongelani vinhu vino muladi lusita vondalufike, mwizakumbuka yaja yonimulongeleni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Usang'hano wa Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Siwalongeleni mbuli zino kusongela mwanduso kwaviya nikala hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Sambi nohita kwa ija yanhumile, mbali habule hata imwe vimwili yoniuza, ‘Kohita kulihi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Kwaviya niwalongela yano yose, mizoyo yenu imema usungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Mbali nowalongela kweli, Muhavu nisegele. Kwaviya one sizasegela, Mtazi hezakwiza kumwenu. Mbali nihasegela nizamtuma kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Nayo vondayeze, kezawalagusa wanhu weli muna iisi ukweli kusonhela uhasanyi na yaja yanogile haulongozi wa Mulungu, kusonhela nhaguso ya Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Wakala weha kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi, kwaviya hawanihuwile niye bule, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>wabananga kwaviya hawayamanyile yalihi yanogile haulongozi ha Mulungu, kwaviya nohita kwa Tata na mweye hamwiza niwona lusita lwingi, <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>iviya weha kwa iyo inhaguso, kwaviya mkulu wa isi ino katagusigwa kamala.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Ninazo mbuli nyingi za kuwalongela, mbali sambi zizakuwa nyingi nani kumwenu kuzimanya. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Muhe Yelile vondayeze, kezamulongozani muna ikweli yose. Hezalonga kwa udaho wake mwenyewo, mbali kezalonga chiya chiyahulike na kezamulongelani yaja yokwiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Iyo kezanitunhiza niye, kwaviya kezawalongela yose yoyapatile kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Vinhu vose viyelinavo Tata ni vangu. Lekamana nimulongelani kuwa Muhe kezamulongelani yaja yoyapatile kumwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usungu na deng'ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina wake, “Kwa lusita ludodo hamwizaniwona, mbali hamwande chidogo mwizaniwona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Wanahina wake wamwenga waiuzagiza, “Vino mbuli ino fambulo jake choni viyalongile, kwa lusita ludodo chizamuwona, mbali hamwande chidogo hachizamuwona? Vino kakala na fambulo dilihi viyalongile kwaviya kohita kwa Tata?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Wagendelela kuiuzagiza, “Vino ‘Lusita ludodo’ fambulo jake choni? Hachivimanyile kolonga mbuli yaki.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu kavimanya kuwa wakala wolonda kumuuza, ivo kawalongela, “Vino mwoiuzagiza nina fambulo jaki vinilongile, ‘Kwa lusita ludodo hamwizaniwona, mbali hamwande chidogo mwizaniwona’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Nowalongela kweli, mwizalila na kuwona usungu muna imizoyo yenu, mbali isi izadeng'helela. Mwizakuwa na usungu, mbali usungu wenu wizagaluka ndenelelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Muke viyokweleka mwana kowona usungu kwaviya saa yake ifika. Mbali yahamala kweleka mwana, kozimiza usungu, kodenelela kwaviya mwana kelekigwa muna iisi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Mweye iviya, sambi muna usungu, mbali nizamuwonani kaidi na mwizadenelela, na habule munhu yoyodaha kuwasegezela ndenelelo yenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Muna isiku iyo hamwizanipula chinhu chochose. Nomulongelani kweli‚ Tati yangu kezamwig'hani chochose chondamumpule kwa zina jangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Mbaka sambi hampulile chochose kwa zina jangu. Puleni mwizakwing'higwa, na ndeng'helelo yenu izakuwa ng'hulu ng'hani.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuihuma isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Nimulongelani mbuli zino zose kwa masimwe. Mbali lusita lukwiza sizalonga na mweye kwa masimwe mbali nizamulongelani funhu funhu mbuli za Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Siku ijo mwizapula kwa zina jangu. Simulongelani kuwa nizanpulilani kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Tata mwenyewo komulondani, kwaviya mweye munonda niye na mutogola kuwa nilawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Niye nilawa kwa Tata na niza muna iisi, na sambi noileka isi na kubwela kwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Maabaho wanahina wake wamulongela, “Sambi kwolonga funhu funhu bila masimwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Lelo chovimanya kuwa kwovimanya vinhu vose, na kwodaha kuidika mbuza yoyose hata ing'hali kuuzigwa. Icho chochitenda chitogole kuwa kulawa kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu kawedika, “Lelo sambi mwonitogola? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Lusita lukwiza, kai lufika lumala, vondamupwililike chila munhu ukaye yake. Mweye wose mwizanileka niidumwe. Mbali sili dumwe bule, kwaviya nahamwe na Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Nimulongelani mbuli zino zose muladi mukale mgati mmwangu na muwe na tindiwalo. Muna isi ino mwizagazigwa. Mwiigangamize! Niye niihuma isi ino!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatosela wanahina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu viyamalile kulonga mbuli izo, kalola kuulanga, kalonga, “Tata, Lusita lufika. Mtunhize Mwanago muladi Mwanago nayo yakutunhize weye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Kwaviya kumwing'ha Mwanago udaho kwa wanhu wose muladi yawene ugima wa siku zose waja wose woumwing'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Uno uwo ugima wa siku zose, wanhu wakumanye weye, Mulungu wa kweli wiidumwe, na wammanya Yesu Chilisito youmtumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Niulagusa ukulu wako muna isi, niikomeleza sang'hano younhumile niisanane. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Lelo tata uning'he utunhizo haulongozi wako, utunhizo uja woukalile nawo weye uja wonikale nawo isi ing'hali haina lumbigwa bule.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Nikutenda umanyike kwa wanhu waja wouninile muna iisi ino. Wanhu wawo wakala wako, weye kunina wawe wangu, na wawo wayamha mbuli yako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Sambi wavimanya vinhu vose vouninile volawa kumwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Niwe na mbuli zouning'hile nawo wazitogola. Wavimanya kuwa kweli nolawa kumwako, na watogola weye iyo unhumile.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Nowatosela. Siwatosela wanhu wa isi ino bule, mbali nowatosela wanhu waja wouning'hile, kwaviya wano ni wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Wanhu wose wonilinawo wako, na wose woulinawo wangu. Na ukulu wangu wowoneka muna iwawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Sambi nokwiza kumwako. Sili muna iisi kaidi, mbali wawo wang'hali muna iisi. Tata Yelile, walolese goya kwa nguvu ya zina jako, zina diuninile, muladi wawe wamwe fana weye na niye vichili wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Vinikalile nawo, niwalolesa goya kwa nguvu ya zina jako douning'hile. Niwakaliza, na habule hata munhu imwe yagile, mbali ija yoyalondeke kwaga muladi Maandiko Yelile yatimie. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Sambi nokwiza kumwako, nilonga mbuli zino zose hanikalie muna iisi, muladi wameme ndenelelo yangu mwiimizoyo yawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Niwe na mbuli yako mbali wanhu wa isi ino wawehila, kwaviya wawo siyo wanhu wa isi ino, fana Niye visili munhu wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Mbali sikupula bule uwasegeze muna iisi, mbali nopula uwalolese na ija imwihi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Fana viya niye visili wa isi ino, iviya wawo siyo wanhu wa isi ino bule. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Uwatende wawe wako kwa iyo ikweli, mbuli yako ni kweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Niwatuma muna iisi, fana weye viunhumile niye muna iisi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Kwa ichimu chawo niye mwenyewo noisafya kwa weye muladi na wawo wasafyigwe haswa kwa weye.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Siwatosela bule wawo muhala. Nowatosela iviya wanhu waja wondawanihuwile niye kwa usenga wawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Notosa wose wawe wamwe. Tata, notosa wakale mgati mmwetu, fana weye viukala mgati mmwangu na niye vinikala mgati mmwako, muladi wanhu wa isi ino watogole kuwa weye kunituma niye. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Niwe na utunhizo uja uja wouninile, muladi wawe wamwe fana cheye vichili wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Niye namgati mmwawo na weye kwamgati mmwangu. Nokulamba wawe wamwe kweli. Maabaho wanhu wa isi ino wavimanye weye kunituma na kuwalonda wawo fana viunilondile niye.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Tata, nolonda wanhu waja wouning'hile wakale na niye hanhu honikala. Wawone utunhizo wangu wouninile kwaviya kunilonda ing'hali isi kulumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Tata unogile, wanhu wa isi ino hawakumanya, mbali niye nokumanya, na wawo wovimanya kuwa weye kunituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Nikutenda wanhu wakumanye, na nizagendelela kutenda ivo, muladi ulondo woulinawo kumwangu ukale mgati mmwawo, iviya na niye nizakala mgati mmwawo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogwiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Masayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliki 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesu viyakomeleze kutosa, yeye na wanahina wake wahita umwambu wa chizanda cha Chidiloni. Hanhu haja hakala na mgunda wa mibiki ya Mizaituni, Yesu na wanahina wake wengila umo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yuda, ija yoyambiduke Yesu, kahamanya hanhu haja kwaviya miyanza mingi Yesu kakala kohita hanhu haja na wanahina wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Ivo Yuda kasola kibumbila cha wakalizi na wasang'hani kulawa kwa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo, keza nawo baho na vitasa na mimuli na silaha. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesu kavimanya yose yondayamulawilile, ivo kawalawilila, kawauza, “Vino mwonzahila yelihi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Nazaleti,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu kawalongela, “Iyo Niye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda yoyambiduke kakala kema hanhu haja hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesu viyawalongele, “Iyo Niye,” wabwela kuchisogo, wagwa hasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesu kawauza kaidi, “Mwonzahila yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Kawalongela, “Nimulongelani mala kuwa iyo niye. One mwonizahila niye, walekeni wano wahite.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Kalonga ivo muladi yaja yayalongile yawe kweli, “Tata, wanhu waja wouning'hile simwagize hata imwe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Saimoni Petili kakala na zele. Kadilava, kamtowa mbande mtumigwa wa mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mulungu, kamkanha gutwi da kulume. Mtumigwa iyo katangigwa Maliki. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu kamulongela Petili, “Bweleza zele jako muna iyala. Nolondeka ning'wile nhungo ya manhesa yoyaning'hile Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Maabaho wakalizi wa Loma na mkulu wawo na Wakalizi wa Kaye ya Mulungu wa Chiyahudi wamgwila Yesu, Wamdaza nzabi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>teng'hu wangala kwa Anasi. Anasi kakala mkoi wa chilume wa Kayafa, yoyakalile mkulu wa nhambiko mwaka uja. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa iyo ija yoyawalongele walangulizi wa Wayahudi. Muhavu munhu imwe yadanganike kwa ichimu cha wanhu wose.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Masayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliki 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Saimoni Petili na mwanahina imwenga wamuwinza Yesu. Kwaviya ija mwanahina imwenga kamanyika na mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo, kahita hamwe na Yesu muna uluhelengo lwa ikaye ya mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Mbali Petili kasigala kunze ya ulwivi. Maabaho ija mwanahina yoyamanyike na mkulu wa nhambiko kabwela, kalonga na mwanamke ija yakalile kokaliza ulwivi. Maabaho mwanamke ija kamulongela Petili yengile mnyumba. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Msang'hani mwanamke ija yoyokaliza ulwivi kamuuza Petili, “Vino na weye huli imwe wa wanahina wa munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petili kamwidika, “Aka, si niye bule.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Kukala na mbeho ng'hani, ivo watumigwa na wakalizi wakogha moto wa makala, wakala wokotela. Nayo Petili kakala kema hamwe nawo kokotela.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu wa Nhambiko digogogo komuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Masayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliki 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Mkulu wa Nhambiko ya Mulungu kamuuza Yesu mbuli za wanahina wake, na mbuli za mafundizo yake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nilonga funhu funhu na wanhu wose. Siku zose mafundizo yangu yatendeka muna zikaye za Mulungu na muna Zikaye za kutosela, hanhu howoitinana Wayahudi wose. Silongile chochose kwa chifiso. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Habali kwoniuza niye? Wauze wanhu wowanihulike. Wawo wavimanya chinilongile.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu viyalongile yano, mkalizi imwe yoyakalile kema habehi kamtowa Yesu kofi, kamulongela, “Habali kwomwidika vino mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu kamwidika, “One nilonga chinhu chihile, lagusa wihi uwo. Mbali one nilonga kweli, habali kwonitowa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Maabaho Yesu yang'hali kadazigwa nzabi, Anasi kamgala kwa Kayafa, mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kombela Yesu kaidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Masayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliki 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Saimoni Petili kakala haja kogendelela kotela moto. Munhu imwenga kamuuza, “Vino weye iviya huli imwe wa wanahina wa munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Mbali Petili kabela na kalonga, “Aka! Si niye bule!”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Mtumigwa imwe wa Mkulu wa Nhambiko, ndugu wa munhu ija yakanhigwe digutwi na Petili kamuuza, “Vino sikuwonile nayo bule kuna umgunda wa mibiki ya Mizaituni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Petili kabela kaidi, kalonga, “Aka.” Bahobaho nzogolo keka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Masayo 27:1-2, 11-14; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliki 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Imitootondo nani Yesu kasoligwa muna ikaye ya Kayafa na kugaligwa mwiimhongono ya mulangulizi wa Loma. Walangulizi wa Chiyahudi hawengile mwiimhongono, kwaviya hawalondile kwambula mwiko muladi wadahe kuja ndiya ya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Ivo Pilato kalawa kunze, kawauza, “Vino mungala munhu ino kabananga choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Wamwidika, “Sigambechingale kumwako bule one habanange chochose.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato kawalongela, “msoleni na mumtaguse kwa malagilizo yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wayahudi wamwidika, “Cheye hachilondeka kumtagusa munhu yoyose yakomigwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Ilawilila vino muladi mbuli za Yesu ziyalongile kulagusa kezadanganika vilihi zitimie.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Maabaho Pilato kahita kaidi mwiimhongono, kamuuza Yesu, “Vino weye kwa Mfalume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vino kwoniuza weye hebu wanhu wamwenga wakulongela mbuli zangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato kamwidika, “Kwovimanya niye siyo Muyahudi. Wanhu wako na wakulu wako wa nhambiko wawo wakugalile kumwangu. Vino kutenda choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ufalume wangu siyo wa isi ino bule. One ufalume wangu uwile wa isi ino, wasang'hani wangu wahadahile kuwalemesa Wayahudi sekewanigwile. Mbali ufalume wangu siyo wa isi ino!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Vino weye kwa mfalume?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu kamwidika, “Weye kwolonga niye na Mfalume. Niye nyelekigwa kwa ichimu icho, na kwa ichimu icho niza mwiisi kuwalongela wanhu mbuli ya kweli. Chila munhu yeli muna ikweli konitegeleza.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Kweli icho ichoni?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu kotagusigwa ifa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Masayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliki 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Maabaho Pilato kalawa kunze, kawalongela Wayahudi “Sipatile banango da munhu ino. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Mbali muna ichihendo chenu, nomulekelelaga mfungwa imwe muna lusita lwa Pasaka. Mwolonda nimulekele Mfalume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Walandula madizi yawo, “Bule! Chifungulile Balaba!” Ija Balaba kakala mbavi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Maabaho Pilato kamsola Yesu yalanhigwe mibalati. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Wakalizi waluka kombelo da miwa, wamvaza Yesu muna iditwi. Maabaho wamuyawaza walo da chifalume. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Wanhu wamuhitila na kumulongela, “Minzamwe mfalume wa wayahudi!” Maabaho wamtowa makofi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato kalawa kunze kaidi, kawalongela Wayahudi, “Loleni, nomulava kumwenu muladi muvimanye sipatile chimu cha kumtagusa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yesu kalawa kunze, kavala kombelo da miwa na walo da chifalume. Pilato kawalongela, “Loleni! Munhu mwenyewo aino hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Wakulu wa nhambiko wa Kaye ya Mulungu na wakalizi viwamuwonile Yesu, walandula yamadizi, “Muwambe mumsalaba! Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato kawalongela, “msoleni mkamuwambe mumsalaba. Mbali niye sipatile chimu cha kumtagusa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Wayahudi wamwidika, “Cheye china lagilizo, na kwa dilagilizo ijo. Munhu iyo kolondeka yadanganike kwaviya kaitenda yeye ni Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilato viyahulike ivo, kadumba nani. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Kengila kaidi mwiimhongono, kamuuza Yesu, “Vino weye kolawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Mbali Yesu hedike bule. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilato kamulongela, “Vino kwolema kulonga na niye? Huvimanyile bule kuwa nina udaho wa kukulekela hebu kukuwamba mumsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Udaho wose woulinawo kumwangu kwing'higwa na Mulungu. Nayo munhu ija yoyanigalile kumwako kana uhasanyi mkulu ng'hani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilato viyahulike ivo, kazahila nzila ya kumulekela Yesu. Mbali Wayahudi walandula madizi yawo, “One uhamulekela, weye siyo mbwiya wa mfalume mkulu wa Loma. Munhu yoyose yoyolonga ni mfalume komulema mfalume mkulu wa Loma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilato viyahulike mbuli izo, kangala Yesu kunze na kukala mchigoda cha nhaguso, hanhu hatangigwe “Luhelengo lwa mabwe.” Kwa Chiyebulaniya “Gabasa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Ikala saa sita imisi, Isiku ya Kuyisasala kwa Pasaka. Pilato kawalongela Wayahudi, “Aino hano mfalume wenu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Mbali walandula yamadizi, “Mkome! Mkome! Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato kawauza, “Vino mwolonda nimuwambe mumsalaba mfalume wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Wakulu wa nhambiko wamwidika, “Chabule mfalume imwenga ila mfalume mkulu wa Loma muhala!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Masayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliki 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Maabaho Pilato kamtula Yesu muna yamakono yawo wakamuwambe mumsalaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Maabaho wakalizi wamsola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesu kalawa kunze kuno kaupapa msalaba wake, kahita hanhu hohatangigwe “Bombwe” Kwa Chiyebulaniya “Goligota”. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Baho wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba. Iviya wawawamba wanhu wamwenga waidi, imwe ubanzi wake wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wake wa kumoso, na Yesu hagati yawo. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato kandika chilaguso, kachika uchanyha ya msalaba. Kandika vino‚ “Yesu wa Nazaleti, Mfalume wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Wayahudi wengi wachisoma chilaguso chino, kwaviya hanhu baho hoyawambigwe Yesu hakala habehi na bululu, na chilaguso chandikigwa kwa Chiyebulaniya na Chilumi na Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Wakulu wa nhambiko wa Chiyahudi wamulongela Pilato, “Sekewandike ‘Mfalume wa Wayahudi’, ila yandika, ‘Munhu ino kalonga, niye namfalume wa Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato kalonga, “Chinyandike nichandika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wakalizi viwamuwambile Yesu, wasola viwalo vake, wavigola vilundi vine, chila mkalizi lundi jake. Iviya wasola ng'hanzu yake, ng'hanzu iyo ikala ilukigwe kwa chihande chimwe cha walo muhala chilibule muluko. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Wailongela, “Sekechididege, leka chitowe mhiya chilole yelihi yondayadipate.” Ilawilila vino muladi Maandiko Yelile yatimile yoyolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Waigolela viwalo vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na ng'hanzu yake waitowela mhiya.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Vino ivo viwatendile wakalizi wawo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Mami yake Yesu na mami yake mkulu hamwe na Maliya, muke wa Chiliyopa, na Maliya Magidalena wakala wemile habehi na msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu viyamuwonile mami yake, na habehi yake kema ija mwanahina iyamulondile, kamulongela mami yake, “Mama, lola, iyo niiyo mwanago.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Maabaho Yesu kamulongela ija imwanahina, “Lola, iyo niiyo mami yako.” Kusongela lusita ulo mwanahina ija kamsola Maliya, kakala nayo ukaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodanganika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Masayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliki 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yesu kavimanya kuwa sambi yose yamala kutimia. Muladi Maandiko Yelile yatimie, kalonga, “Nowona ng'hilu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Hanhu haja hakala na nyhupa ikalile na siki. Ivo wavabika dodoki muna isiki, wadika muna ulumango lwa mbiki wa hisopo, maabaho wadika muumulomo wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu viyafonzile isiki, kalonga, “Chila chinhu chitimiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Maabaho kaidulika iditwi, kadanganika.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohomigwa mgoha mulubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Dikala Isiku ya Kuisasala na Pasaka, na siku isondelele ikala Isiku ya Mhumulo. Walangulizi wa Wayahudi hawalondile bule mitufi ikale muna imisalaba muna Isiku ya Mhumulo kwaviya Isiku iyo ikala siku ng'hulu. Ivo wanpula Pilato magulu ya wanhu wawo wowawambigwe mumsalaba ibenigwe, na mitufi yawo ihulumusigwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Ivo wakalizi wahita, wabena magulu ya munhu wa mwanduso yoyawambigwe mumsalaba hamwe na Yesu, na maabaho wabena magulu ya ija munhu imwenga. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Mbali viwafikile kwa Yesu, wamuwona kadanganika kamala, ivo hawambenile bule magulu yake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Mkalizi imwe kamuhoma Yesu na mgoha mulubavu. Bahobaho ilawa damu na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Munhu ija yawonile chiya chilawilile kachilongela ukalangama muladi chitogole. Na chiya chiyachilongele cha kweli, na kovimanya kolonga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Ilawilila vino muladi Maandiko Yelile yatimie, “Habule hata vuha jake dimwe dondadibenigwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Iviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Wezamulola munhu ija yowamuhomile.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowandigwa mdileme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Masayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliki 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Hamwande, Yosefu yoyalawile chilangulizi wa Wayahudi wa dibululu da Alimasaya kampula Pilato yamwine mtufi wa Yesu. Yosefu kakala mwanahina wa Yesu kwa chinyele kwaviya kakala kowadumba Wayahudi. Pilato kamtogolela, ivo Yosefu kausola, kahita nawo. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Yosefu kailongoza na Nikodemo, munhu ija yoyahitile kwa Yesu ichilo baho umwaka. Nikodemo kakala yagalile mavuta vibaba malongo matatu, yatibwilizigwe na manemane na ubani. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Walusola lukuli lwa Yesu, wauzingiliza sanda hamwe na yaja yamavuta ya kunung'hila ya ichihendo cha Wayahudi cha kuwanda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Hanhu haja hoyawambigwe Yesu hakala na mgunda, na muna umgunda uwo kukala na tuka da sambi, habule munhu yawandigwe muna dituka ijo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Kwaviya dikala Isiku ya Wayahudi Kuisasala, na kwaviya leme dikala habehi, wawika lukuli lwa Yesu umo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Leme muhala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Masayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliki 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Imitootondo siku ya mwanduso ya juma, kung'hali hakunakunguzuka, Maliya Magidalena kahita kuna dituka na kadiwona dibwe dibimbilisigwa kulawa kuna ulwivi lwa dituka. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Kahita yokimbila mbaka kwa Saimoni Petili na kwa ija mwanahina imwenga yoyalondigwe na Yesu, kawalongela, “Wausola mtufi wa Mndewa kuna dileme, na hachivimanyile wawika kulihi!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Maabaho Petili hamwe na ija mwanahina imwenga wahita kuna dituka. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Wose waidi wakimbila, mbali ija mwanahina imwenga kakimbila kumfosa Petili na kandusa kufika kuna dileme. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Kainama na kusungulila mgati, kawona sanda, mbali hengile mgati bule. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Maabaho Saimoni Petili, yakalile kuchisogo chake kafika na kwingila leme. Kawona sanda <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>na chitambala chiyazingiliziligwe Yesu nditwi. Chitambala icho hachikalile na sanda bule, mbali chikala chikuigwa hamgwazo chiidumwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Maabaho mwanahina ija imwenga yoyanduse kufika kuna dileme iviya kengila mgati, kawona na katogola. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Wakala wang'hali hawanavimanya Yamaandiko Yelile viyalongile kuwa Yesu kolondeka yazilibuke. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Maabaho wanahina waja wabwela ukaye yawo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulawilila Maliya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Masayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliki 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Maliya kakala kema kunze ya dileme kolila. Viyakalile yang'hali yolila, kainama na kusungulila mdileme, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>kawawona wasenga wa kuulanga waidi, wayawala viwalo vizelu chwee, wakala hanhu haukalile mtufi wa Yesu, imwe hadikalile iditwi na imwe hayakalile yamagulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Watumigwa waja wamuuza, “Mama, habali kwolila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Nayo kawedika, “Wamsola Mndewa wangu, na sivimanyile bule wamwika kulihi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Maabaho Maliya kahiduka kuchisogo, kamuwona Yesu kema mbali havimanyile kuwa kakala Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Mama, kwolilila choni? Kwonzahila yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Maliya kagesa iyo ni mkalizi wa ichizi, ivo kamulongela, “Mwenevale, one kumsola, nongele kumwika kulihi nihite nikamsole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Maliya kamuhindukila, kamulongela kwa Chiyebulaniya, “Laboni!” Fambulo jake, “Mfundiza.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Sekeunyamhe, kwaviya ning'hali sinahita bule kwa Tata kuulanga. Mbali hita ukawalongela ndugu zangu niye nohita kwa Tati yangu na Tati yenu, Mulungu wangu na Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Ivo Maliya Magidalena kahita. Viyawafikle wanahina, kawalongela, “Nimuwona Mndewa!” Iviya kawalongela chila chiyalongiligwe na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Masayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliki 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Viikalile chigulogulo muna isiku ya mwanduso ya juma, wanahina wakala waiting'hana hamwe mwiikaye. Zinyivi zikala zihindigwe kwaviya wakala wowadumba vilangulizi wa Wayahudi. Maabaho Yesu keza, kema hagati yawo, kawalongela, “Mukale kwa tindiwalo!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Viyakomeleze kulonga yayo, kawalagusila makono yake na lubavu lwake. Wanahina wadenelela nani kwaviya wamuwona Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu kawalongela kaidi, “Mukale kwa Tindiwalo. Fana viya Tata viyanhumile niye, na niye nomtumani mweye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Maabaho kawahumulila, kawalongela, “Hokeleni Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>One muhawalekelela wanhu uhasanyi wawo, wezalekeleligwa, mbali one hamuwalekelele, hawezalekeleligwa bule.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Mwanahina imwe mwa waja wanahina longo na waidi, Tomasi yoyatangigwe Mbasa hawile baho bule Yesu viyezile. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Ivo wanahina wamwenga wamulongela, “Chimuwona Mndewa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Mbali Tomasi kawedika, “One sizaziwona ng'hovu za misumali muna yamakono yake na kwika chidole changu muna zing'hovu izo, na kwika makono yangu muna ulubavu lwake, sizahuwila bule.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Vizifikile siku nane, wanahina waiting'hana hamwe kaidi mnyumba. Tomasi kakala nawo. Nyivi zikala zihindigwe, mbali Yesu keza, kema hagati yawo, kawalongela, “Mkale kwa Tindiwalo!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Maabaho Yesu kamulongela Tomasi, “Ika chidole chako hano, na ulole makono yangu. Maabaho golosa mkono wako uwike mulubavu lwangu. Sekeuleme kutogola, togola!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi kamwidika, “Mndewa wangu na Mulungu wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Vino kutogola kwaviya kuniwona? Wamweda waja wonitogola bila kuniwona!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lungilo da chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu viyakalile na wanahina wake, katenda mauzauza mengi, mauzauza yamwenga hayandikigwe bule muna ichitabu chino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Mbali mbuli zino zandikigwa muladi mutogole kuwa Yesu niiyo Chilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu na kwa kumuhuwila muwe na ugima kwa zina jake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Hamwande Yesu kawalawilila kaidi wanahina wake mumgwazogwazo mwa dilamba da Tibeliya. Ilawilila vino, <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Saimoni Petili, na Tomasi yoyatangigwe Mbasa, na Nasanayeli mkaya wa Kana mwi isi ya Galilaya, na wana wa Zebedayo, hamwe na wanahina wamwenga waidi wa Yesu wakala hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Saimoni Petili kawalongela, “Nohita kuvuwa somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Wamulongela, “Na cheye chohita na weye.” Ivo wahita wakwela ngalawa, mbali chilo chiya chose hawapatile chinhu chochose. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Vikwanduse kukunguzuka, Yesu kema haingema ya dilamba, mbali wanahina hawavimanyile bule kuwa kakala Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Maabaho Yesu kawauza, “Wanike! Mwabule somba yoyose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Wamwidika, “Ona! Chabule.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Maabaho Yesu kawalongela, “Yaseni lwavu lwenu ubanzi wa kulume wa ngalawa, na mwizavuwa somba.” Ivo wasa lwavu mmazi, na hawadahile kukwega lwavu kwaviya wapata somba wengi nani.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Maabaho mwanahina ija yoyalondigwe na Yesu kamulongela Petili, “Ino Mndewa.” Bahobaho Petili viyahulike munhu ija kakala Mndewa, kayawala walo jake, kwaviya kakala kadivula diwalo, kaibwanha mmazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Wanahina wamwenga weza muna ingalawa kwaviya hawakalile kutali bule na isi inyalile, mbali wakala utali wa magulu gana, wakwega lwavu lumemile somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Viwafikile isi inyalile, wawona moto wa makala, somba na magate vikigwa mchanyha yake. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Galeni somba wamwenga womuwavuwile.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Saimoni Petili kengila mwi ingalawa, kalusola ulwavu mbaka kuna isi inyalile. Lumema somba wakulu gana dimwe malongo matano na watatu. Ingawa kukala na somba wengi, lwavu haludumuke bule. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Izoni muje.” Habule mwanahina yamuuzile, “Weye kwa yelihi?” kwaviya wammanya kakala Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesu keza, kasola gate, kaweng'ha. Iviya kasola somba, kaweng'ha.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Ino ikala mwanza wekatatu Yesu kuwalawilila wanahina wake kusongela viyazilibuke.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Viwakomeleze kuja, Yesu kamuuza Saimoni Petili, “Saimoni mwana wa Yohana, vino kwonilonda niye kufosa wano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Saimoni Petili kamwidika, “Ona, Mndewa weye kwovimanya kuwa nokulonda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu kamulongela, “Walolese wana ng'hondolo wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Maabaho Yesu kamuuza mwanza wekaidi, “Saimoni mwana wa Yohana, vino kwonilonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Kamwidika, “Ona, Mndewa weye kwovimanya kuwa niye nokulonda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu kamulongela, “Walolese wana ng'hondolo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesu kamuuza kaidi lweketatu, “Saimoni mwana wa Yohana, vino kwonilonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Saimoni Petili kawona usungu kwaviya Yesu kamuuza lweketatu, “Vino kwonilonda?” Kamwidika, “Mndewa, kwovimanya chila chinhu, kwovimanya kuwa niye nokulonda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu kamulongela, “Walolese wana ng'hondolo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Nokulongela kweli, viukalile mbwanga, kuiyawala mwenyewo na kuhita hanhu houlonda. Mbali vondauwe mulala, kwizayagolosa makono yako na munhu imwenga kezakufunga na kukugala hanhu huhalonda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesu kalonga vino kulagusa Petili vondayadanganike na kumtunhiza Mulungu. Maabaho kamulongela Petili, “Niwinze!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ija mwanahina yoyamulondile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Petili kahinduka, kamuwona ija mwanahina yalondigwe na Yesu kowawinza. Mwanahina ino iyo ija lusita viwakalile woja ndiya ya ichilo kakala habehi nani na Yesu na kumuuza, “Mndewa, vino yelihi yondayakubiduke?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Petili viyamuwonile, kamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa, vilihi munhu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu kamwidika, “One nolonda yakale mgima mbaka vondanibwele, vino na weye yokufunya choni? Weye niwinze niye!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Ivo mbuli izo zenela kwa wandugu kuwa mwanahina ino hezadanganika bule. Mbali Yesu halongile kuwa mwanahina ino hezadanganika bule, ila kalonga, “One nolonda yakale ngima mbaka vondanibwele, vino na weye yokufunya choni?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Ino iyo mwanahina yoyalongile mbuli zino zose na kuzandika, na cheye chovimanya zino zialongile ni za kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uhelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesu katenda vinhu vingi. One chila chinhu chiyatendile chihandikigwe, isi yose sigambeiwe na hanhu ha kwika vitabu vandikigwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
